  "Redemption: 1) Tome of Divinity da Azar Stronghammer (Kharanos) o Brandur Ironhammer (Ironforge). 2) The Tome of Divinity da Tiza Battleforge (Ironforge), poi John Turner (Gates of Ironforge) e Muiredon Battleforge (Ironforge). 3) Vai da Narm Faulk (Helm's Bed Lake, Dun Morogh est) e fai The Symbol of Life: usa il Symbol of Life su di lui -> impari Redemption.",
