  "0{Dwarf Priest:} Alliance. Desperate Prayer (10, self-heal 146–181, CD 10 min), Chastise ( 20, root 2 s umanoidi); Stoneform / Artisan’s Precision (+1% hit, wowclassicforever.info). CC: “Average”.",
  "0• {Human} (Alleanza): Alliance. The Human Spirit (+10% Spirit, agg. 26 ott) e Ruthless (+1% crit): ottimi con Spirit Tap/Meditation. Racial: Divine Grace (10, cura ally <50% e rimuove Weakened Soul, NO self) e Feedback (20). DoubleZug: Human/Gnome secondi per leveling; CC: “Weak” per leveling.",
