  "^spell_shadow_devouringplague^Trainer: Devouring Plague, Fear Ward, Flash Heal, Holy Fire, Mind Soothe, Shackle Undead, Racial 2 (class quest)",
  "Shadowguard (20): quest razziale Troll. Prendila da Aelthalyste (Undercity), Miles Welsh (Spirit Rise) o Ur'kyo (Rocktusk Farm). Ricompensa: Shadowguard (3 cariche, 10 min).",
  "^spell_holy_mindvision^Trainer: Mind Vision",
  "^spell_shadow_manaburn^Trainer: Mana Burn",
  "^spell_holy_blindingheal^Trainer: Binding Heal",
  "^spell_holy_divinespirit^Trainer: Divine Spirit, Mind Control, Prayer of Healing, Shadow Protection, Penance",
  "^spell_shadow_demonicfortitude^Trainer: Shadow Word: Death, Abolish Disease",
  "^spell_holy_layonhands^Trainer: Levitate",
  "^spell_holy_greaterheal^Trainer: Greater Heal",
  "^spell_holy_powerwordshield^Trainer: Power Word: Shield (Rank 7)",
  "^spell_holy_prayeroffortitude^Trainer: Prayer of Fortitude",
  "^spell_holy_prayerofspirit^Trainer: Prayer of Spirit",
  "0{Troll Priest:} Horde. Hex of Weakness (10, 43 AP, 20% heal ricevuti) e Shadowguard (20, 3 cariche 10 min), Berserking (+10% cast speed 15 s), Beast Slaying (“gains a lot of value while leveling”, DoubleZug), Rapid Regeneration. CC: “Best”.",
  "^spell_shadow_psychicscream^Trainer: Psychic Scream, Cure Disease",
  "^spell_holy_heal^Trainer: Heal",
  "^spell_holy_dispelmagic^Trainer: Dispel Magic",
  "^spell_shadow_devouringplague^Trainer: Devouring Plague, Fear Ward, Flash Heal, Holy Fire, Mind Soothe, Shackle Undead, Racial 2 (class quest)",
  "^spell_holy_mindvision^Trainer: Mind Vision",
  "^spell_shadow_manaburn^Trainer: Mana Burn",
  "^spell_holy_blindingheal^Trainer: Binding Heal",
  "^spell_holy_divinespirit^Trainer: Divine Spirit, Mind Control, Prayer of Healing, Shadow Protection, Penance",
  "^spell_shadow_demonicfortitude^Trainer: Shadow Word: Death, Abolish Disease",
  "0{Troll Rogue:} Berserking (+10% haste), Rapid Regeneration (50% HP in 6 s, no cadavere), Regeneration (20% regen in combat), Beast Slaying (+5% vs Beast). Warcraft Tavern: seconda in PvE Orda; Rogue's Diary: 'meno downtime di quasi tutti'.",
  "0{Troll Shaman:} Berserking +10% cast e attack speed per 15 s (aumentato il 27 ott), Rapid Regeneration (50% Health nel tempo), Beast Slaying +5% alle Beast, Regeneration 10% in combat. Rankedboost (snippet): A.",
  "Gan'rul's Summons (Orc/Troll, livello 10): parla con Ophek a Razor Hill, poi con Gan'rul Bloodeye a Orgrimmar. Poi Creature of the Void: recupera il Tablet of Verga per Gan'rul (Skull Rock ). Poi The Binding: usa i Glyphs of Summoning per evocare e sottomettere un Voidwalker, riporta i glifi a Gan'rul. Ricompensa: Summon Voidwalker .",
  "0{Troll Warlock:} Troll (Horde, nuovo Warlock ): Berserking (+10% haste, non vale sui DoT), Rapid Regeneration (canale che cura, ottimo con Life Tap), Regeneration (regen HP in combat), Beast Slaying (+5% danno su Beast, utile nel Barrens). Method: tier C. Inizia nella Valley of Trials come l'Orc.",
  "0{Troll Warrior:} Berserking +10% attack/cast speed per 15 s (3 min CD; nerf rispetto al 30% di Classic), Beast Slaying +5% danni ai Beast, Regeneration (20% dal 16 ott ), Rapid Regeneration (canalizzata).",
  "1. Camp Narache",
  "2. Bloodhoof Village",
  "3. Thunder Bluff",
  "^spell_nature_regeneration^Trainer: Mark of the Wild, Wrath, Healing Touch",
  "Trainer di classe Tauren: Gart Mistrunner (Red Cloud Mesa, Mulgore) o Gennia Runetotem (Bloodhoof Village).",
  "^spell_nature_starfall^Trainer: Moonfire, Rejuvenation",
  "Bag da 6 slot (Grace of An'she and Mu'sha): Seer Graytongue, Red Cloud Mesa. Porta l'incenso al santuario prima dello scadere del timer.",
  "The Adventurer (Chief Hawkwind, Camp Narache, liv. 6), poi The Great Outdoors (Kaga Wildhoof, Bloodhoof Village): sblocca Camping.",
  "^spell_nature_thorns^Trainer: Thorns",
  "Camping 101: Cooking da Kaga Wildhoof: sblocca Basic Campfire.",
