  "0{Undead Rogue:} Cannibalize (35% HP da un cadavere), Touch of the Grave (20% per colpo, drena fino al 5% della vita), Will of the Forsaken. Method la consiglia; Rogue's Diary: meno downtime = leveling stabile.",
  "^spell_shadow_ragingscream^Trainer: Demon Skin, Summon Imp, Shadow Bolt, Immolate",
  "Piercing the Veil (Undead, livello 3): parla con Venya Marthand a Deathknell. Porta 3 Rattlecage Skull. Ricompensa: Summon Imp .",
  "^spell_shadow_abominationexplosion^Trainer: Corruption, Curse of Weakness",
