  "0^spell_frost_frostbolt02,ability_mage_netherwindpresence,spell_arcane_blast,ability_mage_missilebarrage^Frostbolt -> Arcane Wrath -> Arcane Blast ×1–3 -> Arcane Missiles (proc)",
  "0From max range: Frostbolt to slow, Arcane Wrath, then Arcane Blast 1–3 times until Missile Barrage procs, and Arcane Missiles. Each Arcane Blast costs twice the previous one: let the buff drop or you run out of mana. If the mob reaches you: Frost Nova, Arcane Wrath, Fire Blast; finish nearly dead mobs with the Wand (Icy Veins).",
  "0^spell_frost_frostnova,spell_frost_glacier,spell_nature_wispsplode^Frost Nova -> Cone of Cold -> Arcane Explosion",
  "0Gather the mobs, Frost Nova to hold them, Cone of Cold if you have it, then Arcane Explosion. With 3 mobs or fewer it is usually not worth it: it costs too much mana (Icy Veins).",
