  "Class letter: Marshal McBride, Northshire Abbey.",
  "A Scribbled Letter / Consecrated Letter: pick up the quest from Marshal McBride at Northshire Abbey. Follow the Northshire chain (kobolds, Defias) and return to your zone's Trainer. The Paladin starts this way.",
