  "^spell_holy_resurrection^Trainer: Redemption",
  "Redemption: 1) Tome of Divinity from Brother Wilhelm (Goldshire) or Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker (Stormwind). 2) The Tome of Divinity from Duthorian Rall (Cathedral of Light, Stormwind), then follow the steps from Stephanie Turner (Valley of Heroes) and Gazin Tenorm (Stormwind). 3) Go to Henze Faulk (Heroes' Vigil) and do The Symbol of Life: use the Symbol of Life on him to bring him back to life -> learn Redemption.",
