  "^spell_shadow_unsummonbuilding^Talent: Vampiric Embrace 1/1 Heals the party for 20% of Shadow damage: nearly free self-healing, perfect pair with Devouring Plague; great in dungeons and for triggering Spirit Tap in a group.",
