  "Devouring Contagion 2/2 (33–34): DP jumps between mobs. Wand/weapon: keep it updated (DoubleZug).",
  "Talent: Devouring Contagion 2/2 25/50% mana on Devouring Plague and the DoT jumps to 2 nearby enemies when the target dies: helps multi-DoT.",
