  "^spell_warlock_demonsoul^Talent: Dark Inspiration 3/5",
  "Improved Mind Blast 1/5 (Mind Flay ×2 -> Blast needs 4/5 later). Devouring Plague Rank 3, PW:S Rank 6.",
  "^spell_shadow_twilight^Talent: Darkness 1/5 +2%/rank Shadow damage (5/5 = +10%).",
  "^spell_shadow_twilight^Talent: Darkness 2/5 +2%/rank Shadow damage (5/5 = +10%).",
