  "^ability_rogue_rupture^Trainer: Rupture, Poisons (quest)",
  "Poison quest (Alliance): 1) Mathias and the Defias (20) from Master Mathias Shaw (SI:7 HQ, Valley of Heroes). 2) Klaven's Tower (24) from Agent Kearnen (Westfall, east of Sentinel Hill). Steal the Defias Tower Key from a Malformed Drone (level 23) near the entrance, climb the tower, stun or kill Klaven (elite 24) and open the chest. 3) The Touch of Zanzil (20) is optional: it removes the curse. 4) Return to Master Mathias Shaw in Stormwind: from here you can buy the poisons. Alliance is easier.",
  "^ability_marksmanship^Talent: Precision 2/3 Now 3 ranks, +3% total Hit: fewer Misses on attacks and Poison.",
  "^ability_warrior_challange^Talent: Riposte 1/1 150% damage hit + Disarm 6 s after a Parry; Rogue's Diary considered it the best leveling talent before Endurance. Put it in a macro with Sinister Strike.",
  "^ability_rogue_distract^Trainer: Distract, Vanish",
  "Tip (Warcraft Tavern): do the Poison quest from 22, not earlier, because you need Lockpicking 70 and a character strong enough for the elites.",
  "^ability_marksmanship^Talent: Precision 3/3 Now 3 ranks, +3% total Hit: fewer Misses on attacks and Poison.",
  "^spell_shadow_shadowward^Talent: Endurance 1/2 Sprint and Evasion with 60% less cooldown: you use them on almost every hard pull.",
