  "^inv_sword_27^Talent: Hack and Slash 5/5 One talent for all weapons: Dagger/Fist +5% crit, Sword/Axe 5% extra hit, Mace ignores 15% armor. For Method and Warcraft Tavern it's 'make-or-break'.",
  "^ability_racial_bloodrage^Talent: Malice 1/5 +5% crit on all attacks and also on Poisons (which can now crit).",
  "^ability_racial_bloodrage^Talent: Malice 2/5 +5% crit on all attacks and also on Poisons (which can now crit).",
  "^ability_racial_bloodrage^Talent: Malice 3/5 +5% crit on all attacks and also on Poisons (which can now crit).",
