  "^ability_rogue_slicedice^Talent: Improved Slice and Dice 2/3 +45% duration on Slice and Dice: fewer refreshes.",
  "^ability_rogue_slicedice^Talent: Improved Slice and Dice 3/3 +45% duration on Slice and Dice: fewer refreshes.",
