  "^spell_fire_soulburn^Trainer: Searing Pain, Create Soulstone",
  "^inv_elemental_primal_shadow^Talent: Soul Harvest 1/2 Killing a mob with Drain Soul on it doubles your Mana regeneration for 10 sec, even while casting: less Life Tap between pulls. Crix takes it at 19–20: if you drink with the buff up your Mana comes back very fast (maybe a bug). Alternative: Improved Life Tap.",
  "^inv_elemental_primal_shadow^Talent: Soul Harvest 2/2 Killing a mob with Drain Soul on it doubles your Mana regeneration for 10 sec, even while casting: less Life Tap between pulls. Crix takes it at 19–20: if you drink with the buff up your Mana comes back very fast (maybe a bug). Alternative: Improved Life Tap.",
  "^spell_shadow_summonsuccubus^Trainer: Summon Succubus, Summon Incubus, Demon Armor, Ritual of Summoning, Curse of the Elements, Rain of Fire",
  "Devourer of Souls (Alliance, level 20): talk to Gakin the Darkbinder, then to Takar the Seer in the Barrens. Get the Heartswood in Ashenvale (31 31 ) and bring it to Gakin in the Mage Quarter. Then The Binding (Heartswood Core): summon and subjugate a Succubus, bring the core back to Gakin (The Slaughtered Lamb). Reward: Summon Succubus .",
  "The Orb of Soran'ruk (from Doan Karhan, The Barrens 49.2 57.2): bring 3 Soran'ruk Fragments from the Twilight Acolytes in Blackfathom Deeps and 1 Large Soran'ruk Fragment from the Shadowfang Darksoul in Shadowfang Keep. Choose between Staff of Soran'ruk (2H) and Orb of Soran'ruk (off-hand).",
  "^spell_shadow_curseofsargeras^Talent: Improved Bane of Agony 1/2 +5/10% damage to Bane of Agony: the strongest DoT over the long run.",
  "^spell_shadow_curseofsargeras^Talent: Improved Bane of Agony 2/2 +5/10% damage to Bane of Agony: the strongest DoT over the long run.",
  "^spell_shadow_evileye^Trainer: Eye of Kilrogg",
  "^spell_shadow_haunting^Talent: Improved Drains 1/3 Drain Life, Drain Soul and Drain Mana +20% at 3/3: Drain Life becomes your heal and filler until 40. It does not boost Wrack (Crix).",
  "^spell_shadow_haunting^Talent: Improved Drains 2/3 Drain Life, Drain Soul and Drain Mana +20% at 3/3: Drain Life becomes your heal and filler until 40. It does not boost Wrack (Crix).",
  "^spell_shadow_siphonmana^Trainer: Drain Mana, Sense Demons",
  "^spell_shadow_haunting^Talent: Improved Drains 3/3 Drain Life, Drain Soul and Drain Mana +20% at 3/3: Drain Life becomes your heal and filler until 40. It does not boost Wrack (Crix).",
  "^spell_shadow_fingerofdeath^Talent: Fel Concentration 1/3 70% chance at 3/3 not to lose your cast when hit while channeling Drain: this is what makes drain tanking safe.",
  "^spell_shadow_curseoftounges^Trainer: Curse of Tongues, Detect Invisibility",
