  "^spell_shadow_cripple^Trainer: Banish, Create Firestone",
  "^spell_shadow_callofbone^Talent: Grim Reach 1/2 +10/20% range on Affliction spells (Corruption, Bane of Agony, Drain). It replaced Malediction in the Oct 15 notes; costs 2 points but opens row 2.",
  "^spell_shadow_requiem^Talent: Siphon Life 1/1 DoT that heals you (11 HP every 3 s for 30 s) and counts as another effect for Soul Siphon; prerequisite for Wrack.",
  "^spell_shadow_summonfelhunter^Trainer: Summon Felhunter, Subjugate Demon, Hellfire, Siphon Life",
  "Seeking Strahad: talk to Gakin the Darkbinder (Stormwind), Gan'rul Bloodeye (Orgrimmar) or Carendin Halgar (Undercity). Find Strahad Farsan in Ratchet. Then Tome of the Cabal: Alliance from Krom Stoutarm (Ironforge), Horde from Jorah Annison (Undercity) . Ingredients : Moldy Tome (Hillsbrad), Tattered Manuscript (Thousand Needles), 3 Rod of Channeling from the Dragonmaw (Wetlands).",
  "The Binding (Felhunter): use the Tome of the Cabal to summon and subjugate a Felhunter, then bring the tome back to Strahad Farsan in Ratchet. Reward: Summon Felhunter and Box of Souls .",
  "^spell_shadow_lifedrain02^Talent: Soul Siphon 1/3 Drain Life, Drain Soul and Wrack +12% for each of your Corruption, Siphon Life and Bane of Agony on the target (up to +36% at 3/3): DoTs first, drains after.",
