  "Elune's Grace (20): Night Elf racial quest. Pick it up from High Priest Rohan (Ironforge), Nara Meideros or High Priestess Laurena (Stormwind), or Priestess Alathea (The Temple Gardens). Reward: Elune's Grace (50% chance to be hit for 15 s).",
