  "0{Night Elf Priest:} Alliance. Starshards (10, 162 Arcane damage over 6 s, 30 s CD ) and Elune’s Grace (20, 50% chance to be hit for 15 s ), Shadowmeld usable in combat, 2% movement, Wisp Spirit, Elune’s Light. DoubleZug: “quite strong for leveling”, his first Alliance pick; CC: “Good”.",
