  "0{Night Elf Rogue:} Elune's Light (+10% crit for 15 s, every 3 min, pairs with Blade Flurry and Adrenaline Rush), Quickness (+1% Dodge, +2% run speed), Shadowmeld usable in combat, Wisp Spirit. Warcraft Tavern: second place in PvE; Rogue's Diary A-tier; Method recommends it (Elune's Light).",
