  "Coming of Age (Ailee Farheart, Thendal Village): you receive the Ancient Heirloom.",
  "Class trainer Skyborne: Xyton Silverwind (Thendal Village), Naeluna Swiftmend (Shen'dar), Lotheluum Starbreeze (Valanaar).",
