  "6-slot bag (Simple Leather Satchel): The Problem With Prideclaws from Indari Sunseam (Shen'dar Village).",
  "The Adventurer -> The Great Outdoors: The Adventurer from Aetheen of the Gales (Zephras Isle), then turn it in to Raan Wildwind, who gives The Great Outdoors (needs lvl 4).",
  "^spell_nature_thorns^Trainer: Thorns",
