  "0{Orc Warlock:} Orc (Horde): Command (+5% Pet damage, Warcraft Tavern ), Blood Fury (+Spell Power), Shatter Curse (removes Curse/Bane and reduces Magic damage), Hardiness (20% stun duration). Method: tier A; Maxroll recommends the Orc as Horde.",
