  "^spell_shadow_devouringplague^Trainer: Devouring Plague, Fear Ward, Flash Heal, Holy Fire, Mind Soothe, Shackle Undead, Racial 2 (class quest)",
  "Shadowguard (20): misión racial de Troll. Cógela de Aelthalyste (Entrañas), Miles Galés (Spirit Rise) o Ur'kyo (Rocktusk Farm). Recompensa: Shadowguard (3 cargas, 10 min).",
