casters' casts (recipe from the Trainer).", false }, { 24, "Shank", "ability_theblackarrow", "Off-hand strike (50% damage) that gives back 15 Energy: costs 5 Energy, 10 sec cooldown, cannot miss. Rank 2 at 44 (25 Energy).", false }, { 26, "Cheap Shot", "ability_cheapshot", "Stun from Stealth with 2 Combo Points (DonTheCrown: great for farming).", false }, { 30, "Kidney Shot", "ability_rogue_kidneyshot", "Finisher: stun duration scales with Combo Points.", false }, { 30, "Deadly Poison", "ability_rogue_dualweild", "DoT that stacks up to 5; for long fights. For leveling, almost always Instant Poison.", false }, { 30, "Disarm Trap", "spell_shadow_grimward", "Disarms traps (useful in dungeons).", false }, { 32, "Wound Poison", "inv_misc_herb_16", "Reduces healing received; mostly useful in PvP.", false }, { 32, "Blade Flurry", "ability_warrior_punishingblow", "+20% attack speed and hits one extra target for 15 s. 2-minute cooldown with Endurance, paired with Evasion.", true }, { 33, "Hack and Slash", "inv_sword_27", "Passive: Dagger/Fist +5% crit, Sword/Axe 5% extra hit, Mace ignores 15% armor.", true }, { 34, "Blind", "spell_shadow_mindsteal", "Disorients a target (breaks on damage). Reagent: Blinding Powder. Completes the Rogue's kit.", false }, { 37, "Flash of Steel", "ability_rogue_restlessblades", "Shank gives back more Energy and comes back sooner (5 ranks).", true }, { 40, "Safe Fall", "spell_magic_featherfall", "Passive: no fall damage. Same level: Apprentice Riding and Dual Talent Specialization.", false }, { 40, "Adrenaline Rush", "spell_shadow_shadowworddominate", "Energy regen +100% for 15 s (20 Energy per second): burst for 3–5 mobs.", true } } } },
  shaman = { why = { ["Thundering Strikes"] = "+1% crit per Rank on melee AND spells: a flat 5% from 14 and fuel for Flurry.", ["Mental Dexterity"] = "Attack Power = 33/66/100% of your Intellect: Intellect (gear, Incense Candle) becomes AP; unlocks Flurry.", ["Improved Ghost Wolf"] = "Instant Ghost Wolf usable indoors: +40% speed without a mount until 40. It's in row 4 (since Nov 3): Tiqqle takes it at 26–27.", ["Shamanistic Focus"] = "Shocks and Lightning Shield cost 45% less: solves the Mana bottleneck.", ["Elemental Weapons"] = "+20% to Rockbiter Weapon's AP (your imbue until 30), then +40% to Windfury Weapon.", ["Ancestral Knowledge"] = "+2% Intellect (1 point): filler on the way to Stormstrike; Intellect counts with Mental Dexterity.", ["Stormstrike"] = "Your main strike: an extra attack at 100% weapon damage, 8 sec cooldown (Nov 12 hotfix), +20% to your next Lightning Bolt/Chain Lightning/Earth Shock. Taken at 25.", ["Flurry"] = "+5% attack speed per Rank (25% at 5/5) for 3 swings after a melee crit: stacks with Thundering Strikes.", ["Spirit Weapons"] = "Parry and less threat: for solo leveling it's a filler point (Tiqqle takes it at 52).", ["Improved Stormstrike"] = "Stormstrike gives Mana regen (50% while casting for 15 s) and resets when you dodge or parry: Mana sustainability.", ["Mental Quickness"] = "Spell damage = 15/30% of Intellect: boosts Lightning Bolt, shocks and Maelstrom with Intellect.", ["Maelstrom Weapon"] = "Melee hits give stacks that reduce Lightning Bolt's cast time and Mana (up to 5 stacks, 20% per stack at 5/5).", ["Rage of the Farseer"] = "Personal \"Bloodlust\": +30% attack speed for 25 s, 3 min cooldown (Method). At 40.", ["Concussion"] = "+1% damage per Rank to Lightning Bolt/Chain Lightning/Earth Shock: the build's last points (57–60).", ["Elemental Devastation"] = "Spell crits give melee crit (+9% at 3/3 for 10 s): a bridge between shocks and swings.", ["Call of Flame"] = "+15% to Fire Totem, Flame Shock, Fire Nova and +9 s Flame Shock duration (3/3).", ["Elemental Focus"] = "Clearcasting: 10% chance of a free cast, helps Mana.", ["Convection"] = "-2% Mana per Rank on Shock/Lightning Bolt/Chain Lightning (10% at 5/5).", ["Earthbound"] = "Earthbind Totem roots for 5 s: pull control and escape.", ["Trial by Fire"] = "Fire Nova +20% damage and -4 s cooldown; Magma Totem +20 s (2/2).", ["Anticipation"] = "Extra dodge: less damage taken, fewer pauses to heal.", ["Improved Lightning Shield"] = "+15% Lightning Shield orb damage (18–19, as on wowforever.gg of 3 Nov): Improved Ghost Wolf is now in row 4 and cannot be taken before 25.", ["Tidal Focus"] = "-5% Mana on heals and +5% Hit (5/5): first step towards Water Shield.", ["Mindfulness"] = "50% of your Mana regeneration keeps going while casting (3/3): fewer breaks to drink.", ["Totemic Focus"] = "-25% Mana on totems (5/5): you drop them every pull without running dry.", ["Water Shield"] = "3 water globes: when you get hit they restore 2% of your maximum Mana. Solves Enhancement's Mana (Tiqqle and NickTew take it at 42).", ["Elemental Alacrity"] = "-0.5 s cast time on Lightning Bolt and Chain Lightning (3/3): more spells per pull (Tiqqle, 15–17).", ["Eye of the Storm"] = "70% chance not to lose cast time when you get hit (3/3): useful solo, with mobs on you.", ["Lightning Overload"] = "30% chance for Lightning Bolt and Chain Lightning to cast a free second spell at half damage: the bulk of Elemental damage from 30." },
   summary = "Enhancement (2H, melee + totems) is the solo leveling spec that Method (Erik, upd. Oct 23: \"the strongest\"), Warcraft Tavern (\"the cleanest route\"), Mobalytics Tiqqle ({505 }, Verified, upd. Nov 22: the most-saved Shaman guide) and wowforever.be (client data) agree on. Tiqqle's order: Thundering Strikes, Mental Dexterity, Ancestral Knowledge, Shamanistic Focus at 20, Elemental Weapons, Stormstrike at 25, Improved Ghost Wolf, Flurry; from 32 eleven points in Restoration (Tidal Focus, Mindfulness, Totemic Focus) for {Water Shield} at 42, like NickTew (67 ). Mana is the real limit: Elemental and Resto are slower solo.", bsum = { b = "If you prefer staying at range with spells: slower and with more mana to manage (Tavern).", c = "If you level in a group or want healing: solo, Tavern considers it suboptimal; better to use dual spec from 40." }, rot = { { "1–9 · Lightning Bolt + Rockbiter", { { "spell_nature_rockbiter", "Rockbiter Weapon" }, { "spell_nature_lightning", "Lightning Bolt" }, { "spell_nature_earthshock", "Earth Shock (from 4)" }, { "inv_sword_04", "Melee" } }, "Rockbiter Weapon on the weapon. Open with Lightning Bolt from max range; from 4, cast Earth Shock right as the Bolt finishes (the GCD is already ready). Then finish in melee. From 4, the Call of Earth quest gives you Stoneskin Totem and the Earth Totem in Bag (needed for Earthbind at 6 and Stoneclaw at 8). Lightning Shield from 8. (Tavern, Method)" }, { "10–19 · Flame Shock + Searing Totem", { { "spell_nature_lightning", "Lightning Bolt (pull)" }, { "spell_fire_flameshock", "Flame Shock" }, { "spell_fire_searingtotem", "Searing Totem" }, { "inv_sword_04", "Melee" }, { "spell_nature_earthshock", "Earth Shock" } }, "Pull with Lightning Bolt, Flame Shock (refresh it only when it's about to expire), Searing Totem, melee and Earth Shock when it's ready. Fire Nova (12) when the Totem is active and mobs are close. Searing Totem comes with Call of Fire (quest from 10, but the mobs arrive at 14: Tavern suggests grouping or waiting). Before 20 get Improved Ghost Wolf 2/2. Method: you usually pull one mob at a time." }, { "20–24 · Ghost Wolf and cheap shocks", { { "spell_fire_flameshock", "Flame Shock" }, { "spell_fire_searingtotem", "Searing Totem" }, { "spell_nature_earthshock", "Earth Shock" }, { "spell_frost_frostshock", "Frost Shock (slow)" } }, "Shamanistic Focus (20) cuts the cost of Shock and Lightning Shield by 45%: now you can spam shocks. Frost Shock to slow fleeing mobs; Earth Shock to interrupt casts. Instant Ghost Wolf to move. Rockbiter Weapon Rank 4 at 24 (+194 AP, +20% with Elemental Weapons 3/3)." }, { "25–39 · Stormstrike", { { "ability_shaman_stormstrike", "Stormstrike (8 sec)" }, { "spell_nature_earthshock", "Earth Shock" }, { "spell_fire_flameshock", "Flame Shock" }, { "spell_fire_searingtotem", "Searing Totem" } }, "Stormstrike on every cooldown, then Earth Shock (or Lightning Bolt) with the +20%. Keep up Flame Shock and Searing Totem. Flurry (28–29) speeds up your hits after a crit. At 30 switch to Windfury Weapon and a 2H (Method); Improved Stormstrike from 31 for Mana." }, { "40+ · Maelstrom Weapon and Rage of the Farseer", { { "spell_shaman_dropall_01", "Call of the Elements" }, { "spell_fire_flameshock", "Flame Shock" }, { "spell_nature_bloodlust", "Rage of the Farseer (51)" }, { "ability_shaman_stormstrike", "Stormstrike" }, { "spell_nature_earthshock", "Earth Shock" }, { "spell_nature_lightning", "Lightning Bolt (5 Maelstrom)" } }, "Before the pull: Windfury Weapon, Water Shield (from 42, Lightning Shield before) and your 4 totems with Call of the Elements (Searing, Strength of Earth, Mana Spring, Windfury). Flame Shock from range if the mob lives 12 sec; Rage of the Farseer (51, +30% attack speed for 25 sec) on tough mobs; Stormstrike, then Earth Shock (Frost Shock if your threat is too high); Lightning Bolt when Maelstrom Weapon (46) reaches 5 stacks: it is instant and free. With low Mana or the mob under 20% stop casting: full regeneration starts after 5 sec. More mobs: Magma Totem (move it with Totemic Projection), Fire Nova on cooldown with 3 or more mobs, Stormstrike on the mob with the most health, Flame Shock on several targets (Mobalytics – Tiqqle, Nov 13)." }, { "Multiple pulls / AoE", { { "spell_nature_strengthofearthtotem02", "Earthbind Totem" }, { "spell_fire_selfdestruct", "Magma Totem (26)" }, { "spell_fire_sealoffire", "Fire Nova" }, { "spell_nature_chainlightning", "Chain Lightning (32)" } }, "2–3 mobs: Fire Nova (burst, the threat goes to you and not the Totem) with Searing Totem active. 3+ mobs: Magma Totem (26). Earthbind to stop fleeing mobs or to kite. Stoneclaw Totem only to buy a few seconds." }, { "Mana and downtime", { { "inv_drink_08", "Drink" }, { "spell_nature_manaregentotem", "Mana Spring (26)" }, { "spell_nature_magicimmunity", "Healing Wave" } }, "Mana is the Shaman's limit (Tavern). Keep Drink of the right level and drink between pulls; use Shamanistic Focus, Improved Stormstrike and Maelstrom Weapon. After a pull heal with Healing Wave if you have Mana, otherwise First Aid. Lightning Shield always active." } },
   brot = { b = { { "10–29 · Lightning Bolt and Flame Shock", { { "spell_nature_lightning", "Lightning Bolt" }, { "spell_fire_flameshock", "Flame Shock" }, { "spell_fire_searingtotem", "Searing Totem" } }, "Pull with Lightning Bolt, Flame Shock and Searing Totem. Lightning Shield always up (Tavern)." }, { "30+ · Lightning Overload", { { "spell_nature_lightning", "Lightning Bolt" }, { "spell_fire_flameshock", "Flame Shock" }, { "spell_fire_searingtotem", "Searing Totem" } }, "At 30 you get Lightning Overload : Lightning Bolt and Chain Lightning can strike a second time. Pull with Lightning Bolt, Flame Shock and Searing Totem; Lightning Bolt as filler. Call of Thunder (+5% crit) at 44 (Tiqqle)." } }, c = { { "DPS · pull", { { "spell_nature_lightning", "Lightning Bolt" }, { "spell_fire_flameshock", "Flame Shock" }, { "spell_fire_searingtotem", "Searing Totem" } }, "Water Shield always active; Searing Totem and Flame Shock; Lightning Bolt to pull and as filler (Tavern)." }, { "Healing · end of pull", { { "spell_nature_magicimmunity", "Healing Wave" }, { "spell_nature_healingwavelesser", "Lesser Healing Wave" }, { "spell_nature_manaregentotem", "Mana Spring" } }, "Healing Wave as standard heal, Lesser Healing Wave in emergencies; Mana Spring Totem if the group is out of mana (Tavern)." } } },
   notes = { { "Totems: you need the items in Bag", "To cast a Totem you need the element's item {in Bag} (Earth Totem from the quest at 4, Fire Totem at 10, Water Totem at 20, Air Totem at 30). Without the Fire Totem you have neither Searing Totem nor Fire Nova. (Tavern)" }, { "Why Rockbiter until 30", "Method: Rockbiter Weapon gives a lot of AP at these levels and is much better than Flametongue and Frostbrand. From 30 switch to Windfury Weapon with a 2H (Elemental Weapons gives +40% to its bonus)." }, { "Tank with 1H + shield (optional)", "Method: you can tank dungeons with 1H + shield; Rockbiter and Earth Shock generate threat. wowforever.be (classes): Enhancement is designed for 2H only. For solo leveling: 2H." }, { "Elemental rotation (alternative)", "• Lightning Shield, Searing Totem/Magma Totem, Mana Spring Totem.\n• Lightning Bolt as filler.\nTavern: more serious Mana problems and balance still in flux." } }, stats = "Divergent priorities : Method (Erik) Agility > Strength > Stamina > Intellect; Tavern Hit/Expertise > Strength > Intellect > Critical Strike > Spell Damage > Agility. In Forever Mental Dexterity turns Intellect into AP and Mental Quickness into spell damage, so Strength + Intellect makes sense. Weapon: 2H only (wowforever.be, no dual wield); Rockbiter until 30, then Windfury. Call of Air: Tavern mentions Rage of the Storm (2H Mace, ilvl 40, +12 Intellect +15 Stamina from warcraftdb) for Enhancement ; Lightning's Grasp (Elemental) and Tidebringer's Claw (Resto) for the others. Dwarf weapon trainers in Ironforge: Buliwyf Stonehand (fist, 1H/2H axes, 2H mace), Bixi Wobblebonk (daggers); base mace and staff (Tavern). Dwarf's Mace Specialization was removed (Oct 26).", forever = { "Alliance Shaman: Dwarf only; new trainers Teo Hammerstorm, Ingrid Dunwald, Eldrun Stormbreaker (wowforever.be, wmd.json ).", "New Enhancement talents: Mental Dexterity, Shamanistic Focus, Mental Quickness, Improved Stormstrike, Maelstrom Weapon, Rage of the Farseer; Elemental: Lightning Overload, Earthbound (Lava Burst removed on 3 Nov, Call of Thunder is back); Resto: Water Shield, Riptide, Mindfulness (client wowforever.be).", "Stormstrike is a talent at 25 (Tavern); Rage of the Farseer is the personal \"Bloodlust\" at 40 (Method).", "Totem twisting removed; Call of the Elements, Call of the Ancestors, Totemic Recall, Totemic Projection (Totemic Call since 3 Nov) and Astral Recall arrive, with a 15 min cooldown (Tavern).", "Improved Ghost Wolf: Ghost Wolf is instant and usable indoors (Method, Tavern).", "Enhancement is 2H only, no dual wield (wowforever.be, Skidrow).", "Talents: 51 points from level 10, milestones at 11/21/31 points, a new one at 16; respec at the Trainer in a capital; Dual Spec at 40 (wowforever.be).", "Racials Oct 26–27 (Blizzard via Warcraft Tavern): Dwarf Artisan's Precision, Orc without Axe Spec/Savage, Troll Berserking 15 s, Orc Blood Fury 2 min.", "Tavern: the builds are designed for the Beta cap 30; the 60 builds will arrive at launch. Pre-launch data.", "At launch (Blizzard notes of 3 Nov): Earth Shock, Flame Shock and Frost Shock go back to Classic damage; Lightning Bolt deals more; Stormstrike 150% weapon damage and 6 sec cooldown; Maelstrom Weapon triggers twice as often; Mental Dexterity up to 150% of Intellect as Attack Power; Riptide heals over time only, 12 sec cooldown.", "Nov 12 hotfix: Stormstrike at 100% weapon damage and 8 sec cooldown; Mental Dexterity up to 100% of Intellect as Attack Power; Maelstrom Weapon reworked (20% Lightning Bolt cast time and Mana per stack, from about 6 to about 10 procs per minute depending on rank); weapon imbues and weapon totems now work together." },
   races = { ["dwarf"] = "The only Alliance race. Stoneform (10% Physical for 8 s + removes Bleed/Poison/Disease), Artisan's Precision +1% Hit, Big Game Hunter +5% damage to Beasts, Find Treasure. Weapon spec removed. Trainers: Teo Hammerstorm (Anvilmar), Ingrid Dunwald (Kharanos), Eldrun Stormbreaker (Ironforge).", ["orc"] = "Blood Fury +10% AP and Spell Power for 15 s, 2 min cooldown (reduced Oct 27): the best burst for Enhancement. Shatter Curse, Hardiness 20% stun duration, Command useless. Axe Specialization and Savage removed Oct 26. Rankedboost (snippet): top race for Shaman.", ["tauren"] = "War Stomp (stuns multiple enemies, 2 s), Plainsrunning up to +60% speed (2% per stack, not while mounted), Endurance +5% Health (hit and crit removed Oct 26), Cultivation. New trainer: Palah Thunderhoof (Camp Gev'rek).", ["troll"] = "Berserking +10% cast and attack speed for 15 s (increased Oct 27), Rapid Regeneration (50% Health over time), Beast Slaying +5% to Beasts, Regeneration 10% in combat. Rankedboost (snippet): A.", ["skyborne_h"] = "Horde (Windshaper), Zephras Isle: Walk on Air (slow fall), Skysight +15% speed 15 s (30% with Charged for 1 h near an elemental convergence), Wind Blessed +2% Haste, Elemental Insight +5% damage to Elementals. Trainer: Windshaper Boro (Thendal Village 42.8, 23.6). Rankedboost (snippet): B.", ["skyborne_a"] = "Horde (Windshaper), Zephras Isle: Walk on Air (slow fall), Skysight +15% speed 15 s (30% with Charged for 1 h near an elemental convergence), Wind Blessed +2% Haste, Elemental Insight +5% damage to Elementals. Trainer: Windshaper Boro (Thendal Village 42.8, 23.6). Rankedboost (snippet): B." },
   spells = { { 1, "Lightning Bolt", "spell_nature_lightning", "Your ranged attack to open the pull (14–17 damage Rank 1). Rank 2 at 8, 3 at 14, 4 at 20, 5 at 26, 6 at 32.", false }, { 1, "Rockbiter Weapon", "spell_nature_rockbiter", "Weapon imbue: +50 AP and more threat (Rank 1). It stays your imbue until 30 (Method: much better than Flametongue/Frostbrand). Rank 2 at 8 (+79 AP), 3 at 16 (+118), 4 at 24 (+194).", false }, { 1, "Healing Wave", "spell_nature_magicimmunity", "Slow direct heal (37–47 Rank 1) between pulls. Rank 2 at 6, 3 at 12, 4 at 18, 5 at 24, 6 at 32. levels from the Wowhead Forever tooltip.", false }, { 4, "Earth Shock", "spell_nature_earthshock", "Instant: damage, interrupt, taunt. Cast it as soon as Lightning Bolt finishes. Rank 2 at 8, 3 at 14, 4 at 24, 5 at 36.", false }, { 4, "Stoneskin Totem", "spell_nature_stoneskintotem", "Reduces Physical damage (4 Rank 1). Comes with the Call of Earth class quest (which gives the Earth Totem in Bag). Rank 2 at 14, 3 at 24.", false }, { 6, "Earthbind Totem", "spell_nature_strengthofearthtotem02", "AoE slow 10 yd for 45 s: kiting and mobs that flee. With the Earthbound talent it roots them for 5 s.", false }, { 8, "Stoneclaw Totem", "spell_nature_stoneclawtotem", "50-health totem that taunts nearby mobs for 15 s: buys you a few seconds.", false }, { 8, "Lightning Shield", "spell_nature_lightningshield", "Always active (3 orbs). With Shamanistic Focus it costs 45% less. Rank 2 at 16, Rank 3 at 24.", false }, { 10, "Flame Shock", "spell_fire_flameshock", "Fire shock with a 12 s DoT: refresh it only when it's about to expire. Rank 2 at 18, Rank 3 at 28.", false }, { 10, "Searing Totem", "spell_fire_searingtotem", "Learned with the Call of Fire class quest: a totem that attacks for you (9–11 Fire Rank 1). Rank 2 at 20, 3 at 30. Requires the Fire Totem in Bag.", false }, { 10, "Flametongue Weapon", "spell_fire_flametounge", "Fire imbue: Rockbiter is better for now. Rank 2 at 18, Rank 3 at 26.", false }, { 10, "Strength of Earth Totem", "spell_nature_earthbindtotem", "+7 Strength to the group (Rank 1), +14 at Rank 2 (24): you use it yourself (Tavern: keep it up in combat).", false }, { 12, "Fire Nova", "spell_fire_sealoffire", "AoE around the Fire Totem, also good on a single target (Method: your AoE burst). Rank 2 at 22, Rank 3 at 32. Requires an active Fire Totem.", false }, { 12, "Purge", "spell_nature_purge", "Removes 1 magic buff at range, instant.", false }, { 12, "Ancestral Spirit", "spell_nature_regenerate", "Out-of-combat resurrection.", false }, { 16, "Cure Poison", "spell_nature_nullifypoison", "Removes 1 Poison from an ally.", false }, { 18, "Tremor Totem", "spell_nature_tremortotem", "Removes Fear, Charm and Sleep from the group.", false }, { 20, "Ghost Wolf", "spell_nature_spiritwolf", "+40% speed. With Improved Ghost Wolf 2/2 (from 27) it's instant and works indoors: your \"mount\" until 40 (Method: the best from 20 to 39).", false }, { 20, "Frost Shock", "spell_frost_frostshock", "50% slow at range (68–73 Frost Rank 1) to escape or keep mobs away. Rank 2 at 34.", false }, { 20, "Frostbrand Weapon", "spell_frost_frostbrand", "Frost imbue with a 25% slow. Rank 2 at 28. Less useful than Rockbiter for now.", false }, { 20, "Healing Stream Totem", "inv_spear_04", "Comes with the Call of Water class quest: heals the group (5 every 2 s Rank 1).", false }, { 20, "Lesser Healing Wave", "spell_nature_healingwavelesser", "Fast, expensive heal (151–172): for emergencies.", false }, { 20, "Call of the Elements", "spell_shaman_dropall_01", "Drops up to 4 totems from your Totem Bar with one key (totem twisting no longer exists).", false }, { 20, "Totemic Recall", "spell_shaman_totemrecall", "Recalls the totems and gives you back Mana.", false }, { 22, "Totemic Call", "ability_shaman_totemrelocation", "Brings your active totems to where you stand (30 sec cooldown). It used to be called Totemic Projection.", false }, { 22, "Cure Disease", "spell_nature_removedisease", "Removes 1 Disease from an ally.", false }, { 22, "Poison Cleansing Totem", "spell_nature_poisoncleansingtotem", "Removes Poison from the group in pulses.", false }, { 24, "Frost Resistance Totem", "spell_frostresistancetotem_01", "Frost resistance (Fire Totem slot): for specific zones/dungeons.", false }, { 25, "Stormstrike", "ability_shaman_stormstrike", "Instant, melee, 8 s cooldown, costs 8% of base Mana: +20% to the next Lightning Bolt/Chain Lightning/Earth Shock for 12 s.", true }, { 26, "Magma Totem", "spell_fire_selfdestruct", "Pulsing AoE (20 Fire every 2 s for 20 s) for pulls of 3+ mobs.", false }, { 26, "Mana Spring Totem", "spell_nature_manaregentotem", "Restores Mana (4 every 2 s Rank 1) to you and the group: stay put to camp or in dungeons.", false }, { 27, "Improved Ghost Wolf", "spell_nature_spiritwolf", "With 2/2 Ghost Wolf is instant and usable indoors (row 4: at 26–27).", true }, { 28, "Fire Resistance Totem", "spell_fireresistancetotem_01", "Fire resistance (Water Totem slot).", false }, { 28, "Flametongue Totem", "spell_nature_guardianward", "Increases the group's spell damage (Fire Totem).", false }, { 30, "Windfury Weapon", "spell_nature_cyclone", "From 30 you switch to 2H + Windfury Weapon: 20% chance of 2 extra attacks (Method).", false }, { 30, "Grounding Totem", "spell_nature_groundingtotem", "Absorbs one enemy spell every 10 s.", false }, { 30, "Nature Resistance Totem", "spell_nature_natureresistancetotem", "Nature resistance.", false }, { 30, "Call of the Ancestors", "spell_shaman_dropall_02", "Second Totem Bar: another set of 4 totems with one key.", false }, { 30, "Reincarnation", "spell_nature_reincarnation", "Passive: you rise from death (requires an Ankh in Bag).", false }, { 30, "Astral Recall", "spell_nature_astralrecal", "Second Hearthstone with a 15 min cooldown (Tavern); same home. level 30 from the tooltip.", false }, { 31, "Improved Stormstrike", "spell_shaman_improvedstormstrike", "Stormstrike gives Mana regen and resets on every Dodge/Parry.", true }, { 32, "Chain Lightning", "spell_nature_chainlightning", "31–60: Lightning Bolt that chains (85–97 Rank 1).", false }, { 32, "Windfury Totem", "spell_nature_windfury", "31–60: Windfury for the whole group (Tavern: huge).", false }, { 34, "Frost Shock (Rank 2)", "spell_frost_frostshock", "31–60: 126–135 Frost.", false }, { 36, "Earth Shock (Rank 5)", "spell_nature_earthshock", "31–60: 135–142 Nature.", false }, { 40, "Dual Talent Specialization", "spell_nature_magicimmunity", "31–60: two specs (Tavern); Apprentice Riding at 40. With the second spec you can keep Restoration for dungeons.", false }, { 40, "Chain Heal", "spell_nature_healingwavegreater", "31–60: bouncing heal (Wowhead Forever tooltip).", false }, { 40, "Stormstrike (Rank 2)", "ability_shaman_stormstrike", "31–60: new Rank from the Wowhead Forever tooltip (ID 17364).", false }, { 42, "Water Shield", "ability_shaman_watershield", "Water shield: gives back Mana when you get hit (11 points in Restoration, like Tiqqle).", true }, { 46, "Maelstrom Weapon", "spell_shaman_maelstromweapon", "Stacks on melee hits: Lightning Bolt faster and cheaper (spend it at 5 stacks).", true }, { 51, "Rage of the Farseer", "spell_nature_bloodlust", "+30% attack speed per 25 s, cooldown 3 min.", true } },
   bsp = { b = { { 1, "Lightning Bolt", "spell_nature_lightning", "Your ranged attack to open the pull (14–17 damage Rank 1). Rank 2 at 8, 3 at 14, 4 at 20, 5 at 26, 6 at 32.", false }, { 1, "Rockbiter Weapon", "spell_nature_rockbiter", "Weapon imbue: +50 AP and more threat (Rank 1). It stays your imbue until 30 (Method: much better than Flametongue/Frostbrand). Rank 2 at 8 (+79 AP), 3 at 16 (+118), 4 at 24 (+194).", false }, { 1, "Healing Wave", "spell_nature_magicimmunity", "Slow direct heal (37–47 Rank 1) between pulls. Rank 2 at 6, 3 at 12, 4 at 18, 5 at 24, 6 at 32. levels from the Wowhead Forever tooltip.", false }, { 4, "Earth Shock", "spell_nature_earthshock", "Instant: damage, interrupt, taunt. Cast it as soon as Lightning Bolt finishes. Rank 2 at 8, 3 at 14, 4 at 24, 5 at 36.", false }, { 4, "Stoneskin Totem", "spell_nature_stoneskintotem", "Reduces Physical damage (4 Rank 1). Comes with the Call of Earth class quest (which gives the Earth Totem in Bag). Rank 2 at 14, 3 at 24.", false }, { 6, "Earthbind Totem", "spell_nature_strengthofearthtotem02", "AoE slow 10 yd for 45 s: kiting and mobs that flee. With the Earthbound talent it roots them for 5 s.", false }, { 8, "Stoneclaw Totem", "spell_nature_stoneclawtotem", "50-health totem that taunts nearby mobs for 15 s: buys you a few seconds.", false }, { 8, "Lightning Shield", "spell_nature_lightningshield", "Always active (3 orbs). With Shamanistic Focus it costs 45% less. Rank 2 at 16, Rank 3 at 24.", false }, { 10, "Flame Shock", "spell_fire_flameshock", "Fire shock with a 12 s DoT: refresh it only when it's about to expire. Rank 2 at 18, Rank 3 at 28.", false }, { 10, "Searing Totem", "spell_fire_searingtotem", "Learned with the Call of Fire class quest: a totem that attacks for you (9–11 Fire Rank 1). Rank 2 at 20, 3 at 30. Requires the Fire Totem in Bag.", false }, { 10, "Flametongue Weapon", "spell_fire_flametounge", "Fire imbue: Rockbiter is better for now. Rank 2 at 18, Rank 3 at 26.", false }, { 10, "Strength of Earth Totem", "spell_nature_earthbindtotem", "+7 Strength to the group (Rank 1), +14 at Rank 2 (24): you use it yourself (Tavern: keep it up in combat).", false }, { 12, "Fire Nova", "spell_fire_sealoffire", "AoE around the Fire Totem, also good on a single target (Method: your AoE burst). Rank 2 at 22, Rank 3 at 32. Requires an active Fire Totem.", false }, { 12, "Purge", "spell_nature_purge", "Removes 1 magic buff at range, instant.", false }, { 12, "Ancestral Spirit", "spell_nature_regenerate", "Out-of-combat resurrection.", false }, { 16, "Cure Poison", "spell_nature_nullifypoison", "Removes 1 Poison from an ally.", false }, { 18, "Tremor Totem", "spell_nature_tremortotem", "Removes Fear, Charm and Sleep from the group.", false }, { 20, "Ghost Wolf", "spell_nature_spiritwolf", "+40% speed. With Improved Ghost Wolf 2/2 (from 27) it's instant and works indoors: your \"mount\" until 40 (Method: the best from 20 to 39).", false }, { 20, "Frost Shock", "spell_frost_frostshock", "50% slow at range (68–73 Frost Rank 1) to escape or keep mobs away. Rank 2 at 34.", false }, { 20, "Frostbrand Weapon", "spell_frost_frostbrand", "Frost imbue with a 25% slow. Rank 2 at 28. Less useful than Rockbiter for now.", false }, { 20, "Healing Stream Totem", "inv_spear_04", "Comes with the Call of Water class quest: heals the group (5 every 2 s Rank 1).", false }, { 20, "Lesser Healing Wave", "spell_nature_healingwavelesser", "Fast, expensive heal (151–172): for emergencies.", false }, { 20, "Call of the Elements", "spell_shaman_dropall_01", "Drops up to 4 totems from your Totem Bar with one key (totem twisting no longer exists).", false }, { 20, "Totemic Recall", "spell_shaman_totemrecall", "Recalls the totems and gives you back Mana.", false }, { 22, "Totemic Call", "ability_shaman_totemrelocation", "Brings your active totems to where you stand (30 sec cooldown). It used to be called Totemic Projection.", false }, { 22, "Cure Disease", "spell_nature_removedisease", "Removes 1 Disease from an ally.", false }, { 22, "Poison Cleansing Totem", "spell_nature_poisoncleansingtotem", "Removes Poison from the group in pulses.", false }, { 24, "Frost Resistance Totem", "spell_frostresistancetotem_01", "Frost resistance (Fire Totem slot): for specific zones/dungeons.", false }, { 26, "Magma Totem", "spell_fire_selfdestruct", "Pulsing AoE (20 Fire every 2 s for 20 s) for pulls of 3+ mobs.", false }, { 26, "Mana Spring Totem", "spell_nature_manaregentotem", "Restores Mana (4 every 2 s Rank 1) to you and the group: stay put to camp or in dungeons.", false }, { 28, "Fire Resistance Totem", "spell_fireresistancetotem_01", "Fire resistance (Water Totem slot).", false }, { 28, "Flametongue Totem", "spell_nature_guardianward", "Increases the group's spell damage (Fire Totem).", false }, { 30, "Windfury Weapon", "spell_nature_cyclone", "From 30 you switch to 2H + Windfury Weapon: 20% chance of 2 extra attacks (Method).", false }, { 30, "Grounding Totem", "spell_nature_groundingtotem", "Absorbs one enemy spell every 10 s.", false }, { 30, "Nature Resistance Totem", "spell_nature_natureresistancetotem", "Nature resistance.", false }, { 30, "Call of the Ancestors", "spell_shaman_dropall_02", "Second Totem Bar: another set of 4 totems with one key.", false }, { 30, "Reincarnation", "spell_nature_reincarnation", "Passive: you rise from death (requires an Ankh in Bag).", false }, { 30, "Astral Recall", "spell_nature_astralrecal", "Second Hearthstone with a 15 min cooldown (Tavern); same home. level 30 from the tooltip.", false }, { 32, "Chain Lightning", "spell_nature_chainlightning", "31–60: Lightning Bolt that chains (85–97 Rank 1).", false }, { 32, "Windfury Totem", "spell_nature_windfury", "31–60: Windfury for the whole group (Tavern: huge).", false }, { 34, "Frost Shock (Rank 2)", "spell_frost_frostshock", "31–60: 126–135 Frost.", false }, { 36, "Earth Shock (Rank 5)", "spell_nature_earthshock", "31–60: 135–142 Nature.", false }, { 40, "Dual Talent S