 s Rank 1).", false }, { 20, "Lesser Healing Wave", "spell_nature_healingwavelesser", "Fast, expensive heal (151–172): for emergencies.", false }, { 20, "Call of the Elements", "spell_shaman_dropall_01", "Drops up to 4 totems from your Totem Bar with one key (totem twisting no longer exists).", false }, { 20, "Totemic Recall", "spell_shaman_totemrecall", "Recalls the totems and gives you back Mana.", false }, { 20, "Water Shield", "ability_shaman_watershield", "Water shield: gives back Mana when you get hit (11 points in Restoration, like Tiqqle).", true }, { 22, "Totemic Call", "ability_shaman_totemrelocation", "Brings your active totems to where you stand (30 sec cooldown). It used to be called Totemic Projection.", false }, { 22, "Cure Disease", "spell_nature_removedisease", "Removes 1 Disease from an ally.", false }, { 22, "Poison Cleansing Totem", "spell_nature_poisoncleansingtotem", "Removes Poison from the group in pulses.", false }, { 24, "Frost Resistance Totem", "spell_frostresistancetotem_01", "Frost resistance (Fire Totem slot): for specific zones/dungeons.", false }, { 25, "Mana Tide Totem (talent)", "spell_frost_summonwaterelemental", "", true }, { 26, "Magma Totem", "spell_fire_selfdestruct", "Pulsing AoE (20 Fire every 2 s for 20 s) for pulls of 3+ mobs.", false }, { 26, "Mana Spring Totem", "spell_nature_manaregentotem", "Restores Mana (4 every 2 s Rank 1) to you and the group: stay put to camp or in dungeons.", false }, { 28, "Fire Resistance Totem", "spell_fireresistancetotem_01", "Fire resistance (Water Totem slot).", false }, { 28, "Flametongue Totem", "spell_nature_guardianward", "Increases the group's spell damage (Fire Totem).", false }, { 30, "Windfury Weapon", "spell_nature_cyclone", "From 30 you switch to 2H + Windfury Weapon: 20% chance of 2 extra attacks (Method).", false }, { 30, "Grounding Totem", "spell_nature_groundingtotem", "Absorbs one enemy spell every 10 s.", false }, { 30, "Nature Resistance Totem", "spell_nature_natureresistancetotem", "Nature resistance.", false }, { 30, "Call of the Ancestors", "spell_shaman_dropall_02", "Second Totem Bar: another set of 4 totems with one key.", false }, { 30, "Reincarnation", "spell_nature_reincarnation", "Passive: you rise from death (requires an Ankh in Bag).", false }, { 30, "Astral Recall", "spell_nature_astralrecal", "Second Hearthstone with a 15 min cooldown (Tavern); same home. level 30 from the tooltip.", false }, { 30, "Nature's Swiftness (talent)", "spell_nature_ravenform", "", true }, { 32, "Chain Lightning", "spell_nature_chainlightning", "31–60: Lightning Bolt that chains (85–97 Rank 1).", false }, { 32, "Windfury Totem", "spell_nature_windfury", "31–60: Windfury for the whole group (Tavern: huge).", false }, { 34, "Frost Shock (Rank 2)", "spell_frost_frostshock", "31–60: 126–135 Frost.", false }, { 36, "Earth Shock (Rank 5)", "spell_nature_earthshock", "31–60: 135–142 Nature.", false }, { 40, "Dual Talent Specialization", "spell_nature_magicimmunity", "31–60: two specs (Tavern); Apprentice Riding at 40. With the second spec you can keep Restoration for dungeons.", false }, { 40, "Chain Heal", "spell_nature_healingwavegreater", "31–60: bouncing heal (Wowhead Forever tooltip).", false }, { 40, "Stormstrike (Rank 2)", "ability_shaman_stormstrike", "31–60: new Rank from the Wowhead Forever tooltip (ID 17364).", false }, { 40, "Riptide (talent)", "spell_nature_riptide", "", true } } } },
  warlock = { why = { ["Improved Corruption"] = "5 ranks = instant Corruption (2 s cast) and +10% damage: you apply it on the move to every mob. All sources take it first.", ["Suppression"] = "+1% Hit per rank (5% at 5/5) and less threat: with 4 ranks you never miss a mob of your level, with 5 also higher ones.", ["Grim Reach"] = "+10/20% range on Affliction spells (Corruption, Bane of Agony, Drain). It replaced Malediction in the Oct 15 notes; costs 2 points but opens row 2.", ["Improved Drains"] = "Drain Life, Drain Soul and Drain Mana +20% at 3/3: Drain Life becomes your heal and filler until 40. It does not boost Wrack (Crix).", ["Nightfall"] = "4% (2/2) chance that Corruption/Drain grants Shadow Trance: instant Shadow Bolt to use right away.", ["Fel Concentration"] = "70% chance at 3/3 not to lose your cast when hit while channeling Drain: this is what makes drain tanking safe.", ["Soul Siphon"] = "Drain Life, Drain Soul and Wrack +12% for each of your Corruption, Siphon Life and Bane of Agony on the target (up to +36% at 3/3): DoTs first, drains after.", ["Siphon Life"] = "DoT that heals you (11 HP every 3 s for 30 s) and counts as another effect for Soul Siphon; prerequisite for Wrack.", ["Pandemic"] = "+33% to the crit bonus of your DoTs per rank (+100% at 3/3). New : DoTs can crit in Forever. Only worth it with crit from Malevolence/Shadow Mastery, which is why it comes late.", ["Shadow Mastery"] = "+2% per rank (10% at 5/5) to Shadow damage and life drain: the biggest multiplier in the tree; unlocks the Wrack row.", ["Wrack"] = "Affliction capstone (level 40, reworked on Nov 10): 6 sec channel, 60 Shadow per second, and meanwhile your Corruption, Siphon Life and Bane of Agony deal their damage twice as fast. From 40 it is the filler: DoTs, then Wrack; Drain Life when you need health (Crix).", ["Unholy Power"] = "+2% damage per rank (10% at 5/5) to all demons: the Succubus kills faster while you drain-tank.", ["Demonic Energies"] = "Heals your demon for 8/15% of the damage you deal and passes it the mana from Life Tap: less Health Funnel.", ["Malevolence"] = "+1% crit per rank (5% at 5/5) to Shadow spells: makes crit DoTs and Pandemic pay off.", ["Fel Vitality"] = "+5/15% to your demon's Health and Mana and to your maximum Mana: more Life Tap and a sturdier demon. Crix takes it at 46–48 for the Mana problems of the 50s.", ["Improved Bane of Agony"] = "+5/10% damage to Bane of Agony: the strongest DoT over the long run.", ["Improved Life Tap"] = "+10/20% mana from Life Tap: combined with Drain Life, every HP drained is worth 1,2 mana.", ["Master Summoner"] = "-4 s cast time and -40% Mana to summon demons (2/2): you bring it back right away if it dies.", ["Improved Sayaad"] = "+30% to Succubus/Incubus Lash of Pain and Soothing Kiss (3/3): the demon that deals the most damage (Crix).", ["Demonic Brand"] = "Searing Pain deals half threat and brands the target: your pet's next 6 attacks deal extra damage (with high threat if Shadow). The pet holds the mob.", ["Fel Domination"] = "Your next demon is summoned 5.5 s faster and costs 50% less: saves pulls gone wrong.", ["Demonic Sacrifice"] = "You sacrifice your demon for a 2-hour bonus, which ends if you summon a demon. Imp: +15% Shadow damage (Crix's pick in build A, from 51); Voidwalker: 2% of your Mana every 4 sec; Succubus/Incubus: +15% Fire damage; Felhunter: 3% of your Health every 4 sec.", ["Soul Harvest"] = "Killing a mob with Drain Soul on it doubles your Mana regeneration for 10 sec, even while casting: less Life Tap between pulls. Crix takes it at 19–20: if you drink with the buff up your Mana comes back very fast (maybe a bug). Alternative: Improved Life Tap.", ["Amplify Curse"] = "Your next Curse of Weakness or Bane of Agony +50% (Curse of Exhaustion +20%): a free point, needed for Curse of Exhaustion.", ["Curse of Exhaustion"] = "Slows the target by 30% for 12 sec: the Warlock's only slow, useful against fleeing mobs or on PvP servers.", ["Improved Shadow Bolt"] = "Shadow Bolt crits make the target take 20% more Shadow damage for 12 sec: from 50, with Nightfall procs (instant Shadow Bolt), it also boosts DoTs and Wrack.", ["Bane"] = "Shadow Bolt and Immolate 0.5 sec faster: points on the way to Shadowburn; Crix recommends it on PvE servers (useful in dungeons), Molten Skin on PvP ones.", ["Shadowburn"] = "Instant Shadow damage to finish the mob; if it dies within 8 sec you get a Soul Shard. The build's last point (60).", ["Demonic Embrace"] = "+3% Stamina per rank (15% at 5/5): more Health, because as a drain tank you take the hits (Crix, 41–45).", ["Demonic Aegis"] = "+15% per rank to Demon Skin and Demon Armor: not worth much, but you need 2 more points in the tree to unlock Demonic Sacrifice (Crix, 49–50)." },
   summary = "Affliction (drain tank with Voidwalker/Succubus) is the most recommended leveling spec: instant DoTs, Life Tap and Drain Life keep Health and Mana up with no downtime, and from 40 {Wrack} (reworked with the Nov 10 hotfix) is the filler that deals damage and speeds up your DoTs. The talent order follows Mobalytics – Crix (Verified, {922 }, upd. Nov 23, the most saved Warlock guide): Soul Harvest at 19, drains from 23, Siphon Life at 30, Wrack at 40, then 11 points in Demonology up to Demonic Sacrifice (51) and Pandemic and Malevolence at the end (40/11/0). wowforever.be and Method (Pandemic/Malevolence first, Oct 17) are the minority order, listed in alternatives.", bsum = { b = "If you want a strong pet and Soul Link's survivability (31): Crix gives it as the second choice after Affliction.", c = "Same spec as A with early Pandemic and a few Demonology points from 46: for those who want wowforever.be's order." }, rot = { { "1–9 · Imp + Immolate + Wand", { { "spell_fire_immolation", "Immolate" }, { "spell_shadow_abominationexplosion", "Corruption (4)" }, { "spell_shadow_shadowbolt", "Shadow Bolt" }, { "ability_marksmanship", "Wand" } }, "Summon the Imp, open with Immolate (buy it at level 1 from the Trainer, 10 copper), then Corruption from 4. Finish with Wand or auto-attack until you have the Wand. Shadow Bolt costs too much: use it to finish. Sell the starting gear to pay for Immolate. Life Tap from 6 (then eat), Bane of Agony from 8 to tag." }, { "10–19 · Voidwalker + DoT + Wand", { { "spell_shadow_summonvoidwalker", "Pet attack" }, { "spell_shadow_curseofsargeras", "Bane of Agony" }, { "spell_shadow_abominationexplosion", "Corruption" }, { "spell_fire_immolation", "Immolate" }, { "ability_marksmanship", "Wand" } }, "Pet attack, then Bane of Agony (tags, the demon takes the threat), Corruption (instant at 14 with Improved Corruption 5/5), Immolate if the mob lives >8 s. Finish with the Wand, which does more damage than Drain Life until 29. Life Tap between pulls. Drain Soul for the last hit when you need Soul Shards." }, { "20–29 · Succubus and Drain", { { "spell_shadow_summonsuccubus", "Pet attack" }, { "spell_shadow_curseofsargeras", "Bane of Agony" }, { "spell_shadow_abominationexplosion", "Corruption" }, { "spell_shadow_lifedrain02", "Drain Life" }, { "spell_shadow_burningspirit", "Life Tap" } }, "From 20 you can use the Succubus (more damage but it can't hold threat: you take the hits). With Improved Drains, Fel Concentration and Grim Reach (23–29) use Drain Life when you need Health; otherwise Wand. Warcraft Tavern's rule: more Health than Mana -> Life Tap; more Mana than Health -> Drain Life. With Soul Harvest (19–20) finish mobs with Drain Soul and drink with the buff up: your Mana comes back fast (Crix)." }, { "30–39 · Drain tanking", { { "spell_shadow_summonsuccubus", "Pet attack" }, { "spell_shadow_curseofsargeras", "Bane of Agony" }, { "spell_shadow_abominationexplosion", "Corruption" }, { "spell_shadow_requiem", "Siphon Life" }, { "spell_shadow_lifedrain02", "Drain Life" } }, "From 30, Drain Life Rank 3 + Soul Siphon (+12% per DoT on the target) make Drain your filler: DoTs, then Drain Life until death; Wand only at full HP or on an almost dead mob. Siphon Life from 30. Drain gets really strong with Rank 4 at 38: before that the Wand still deals good damage (Crix)." }, { "40+ · Wrack as filler", { { "spell_shadow_summonsuccubus", "Pet attack" }, { "spell_shadow_curseofsargeras", "Bane of Agony" }, { "spell_shadow_abominationexplosion", "Corruption" }, { "spell_shadow_requiem", "Siphon Life" }, { "warlock_curse_shadow", "Curse of the Elements" }, { "ability_deathknight_hemorrhagicfever", "Wrack" }, { "spell_shadow_lifedrain02", "Drain Life (health)" } }, "Until 51 send in your demon and let it hit first (the Succubus deals more damage). Amplify Curse if you have it, then Bane of Agony, Corruption, Siphon Life and Curse of the Elements if the mob won't die right away (up to +10% magic damage). {Wrack} is the filler: it deals a lot of damage and meanwhile your DoTs tick twice as fast. Drain Life when you need Health fast. From 51 sacrifice your Imp with Demonic Sacrifice (+15% Shadow damage for 2 hours) and keep going without a demon (Crix). Drain Soul to finish if you need Soul Shards. While your DoTs finish one mob, start on the next (Mobalytics – Crix, Nov 14)." }, { "Multiple pulls", { { "spell_shadow_possession", "Fear" }, { "spell_shadow_abominationexplosion", "DoT on the 1st" }, { "spell_shadow_summonvoidwalker", "Demon on the 2nd" }, { "spell_shadow_lifedrain02", "Drain" } }, "After 22: DoT the first mob and Fear, the demon holds the second; return to the first when it's back. With Fel Concentration 3/3 you can drain while being hit. Use a focus target for DoTs. If Fear runs toward another group, break it with Curse of Recklessness." }, { "AoE", { { "spell_shadow_abominationexplosion", "Corruption on all" }, { "spell_shadow_curseofsargeras", "Bane of Agony" }, { "spell_fire_incinerate", "Hellfire (30)" }, { "spell_shadow_rainoffire", "Rain of Fire (20)" } }, "3+ mobs: DoTs on all and Hellfire/Rain of Fire (Maxroll), but watch your HP. Only Destruction has scalable AoE. Prefer the Voidwalker for big pulls." } },
   brot = { b = { { "10–25 · Pet, DoTs and Shadow Bolt", { { "spell_shadow_summonvoidwalker", "Pet attack" }, { "spell_fire_immolation", "Immolate" }, { "spell_shadow_curseofsargeras", "Bane of Agony" }, { "spell_shadow_shadowbolt", "Shadow Bolt" }, { "ability_marksmanship", "Wand" } }, "Pet attack before every attack, then Immolate and Bane of Agony; finish with Shadow Bolt and Wand (Method)." }, { "26+ · Demonic Brand", { { "spell_shadow_metamorphosis", "Demonic Brand" }, { "spell_fire_soulburn", "Searing Pain" } }, "Searing Pain only after Demonic Brand: before that it can take the mob off the pet (Method)." } } },
   notes = { { "Health/Mana management", "Health and mana are a single resource: {Life Tap} converts HP into Mana, {Drain Life} gives them back. Keep Demon Skin/Armor up. Stamina matters a bit more than for other casters. First Aid: bandage between pulls or while a mob is feared, then Life Tap. Always keep a Healthstone (separate cooldown). Sources: Warcraft Tavern, Method." }, { "Soul Shard", "Needed for Voidwalker, Succubus/Incubus, Felhunter, Healthstone, Soulstone, Ritual of Summoning, Shadowburn. While your demon tanks, channel {Drain Soul Rank 1} to make shards . Bags: Small Soul Pouch (14 slots, Succubus quest), Box of Souls (16, Felhunter quest); the Soul Shard Bag now goes in the reagent slot (Warcraft Tavern, forg.gg)." }, { "Useful macros (GuideMMO, 15k views, Oct 31)", "• #showtooltip /castsequence reset=combat/target Immolate, Bane of Agony, Corruption\n• /cast [nochanneling] Drain Life\n• /cast [@mouseover] Fear\nA comment on the video warns: don't put Pet Attack in the same macro as an offensive spell; keep Pet commands on separate keys (scroll wheel). The Move command is new ." }, { "When to go to the Trainer", "Rank levels: Corruption 4/14/24/34, Life Tap 6/16/26/36, Drain Life 14/22/30/38, Bane of Agony 8/18/28/38, Shadow Bolt 6/12/20/28/36. Demon Grimoires (Imp/Voidwalker/Succubus/Felhunter) are bought from the Demon Trainer and are expensive (Method). Levels from the Wowhead Forever tooltips." } }, stats = "Leveling priority: Spell Power/Shadow Damage > Wand DPS (until 30) > Intellect/Spirit > Stamina (Warcraft Tavern; Maxroll: Spellpower, Intellect, Spirit; Spirit scales Life Tap). The main-hand is a 'stat stick': Spell Power matters, not its damage. Wands: Novice's Practice Wand (1), Lesser Magic Wand (5, ~11,3 DPS), Greater Magic Wand (13, ~17,5 DPS), Gravestone Scepter (Blackfathom Deeps, 29 DPS), Greater Mystic Wand (30). Weapons: Staff of Soran'ruk or Orb of Soran'ruk (quest 20), Staff of the Shade (Razorfen Kraul, rare drop), Golemheart Stave (Hall of Thanes), Emberstone Staff and Cookie's Stirring Rod (Deadmines) (Maxroll). Wands no longer benefit from Spell Power .", forever = { "DoTs (Corruption, Bane of Agony, Siphon Life, Drain...) can crit: Pandemic and Malevolence increase their value (Method Oct 17; wowforeverbuilds Oct 24).", "Bane of Agony (level 8) replaces Curse of Agony: instant and tags the mob. Curse and Bane are separate: one of each per target (Warcraft Tavern).", "Life Tap scales with Spirit: converts (30 + Spirit) HP into Mana (client Wowhead Forever tooltip).", "Drain Soul can give a Soul Shard on each tick; a non-trivial mob killed = guaranteed shard (Warcraft Tavern, WoW Forever Guides on client 70009).", "Soul Shard Bag in the reagent slot; Small Soul Pouch 14 slots (was 12), Box of Souls 16 slots (forg.gg).", "Fear now has 20 yd (was 24 in beta): Blizzard forum via wowforeverbuilds. Still one target, 10 s.", "Incubus as a separate demon from the Succubus (Sayaad) with its own quest chain (forg.gg Oct 9).", "The Meeting Stone no longer summons: only Ritual of Summoning (Method, Warcraft Tavern).", "New/changed talents in client 70707: Improved Corruption (Changed), Suppression (Changed: +1% Hit and 4% threat per rank), Pandemic, Malevolence, Soul Harvest, Improved Drains, Wrack (New), Soul Siphon, Fel Concentration, Siphon Life (Changed), Demonic Energies, Demonic Brand, Decimation (New).", "Grim Reach (2 ranks) replaced Malediction 5/5 in the Oct 15 notes; Soul Harvesting was renamed Soul Harvest on Oct 1 (WoW Forever Guides, Harenil Oct 21).", "Voidwalker: Torment +threat for 5 levels after each new Rank, then fixed; from 25 to 30 it loses mobs more often until Torment Rank 3 (30). Sacrifice scales with 10% of spell healing (notes Sep 24).", "Wands no longer scale with Spell Power: Wand DPS matters until 30 (Warcraft Tavern, WoW Forever Guides).", "Legacy (unconfirmed, wowforeverbuilds Oct 24): Talented (5 points) gives talents from level 5 instead of 10; Well Rested; Thrill of Adventure (5% HP/mana per kill).", "Not found: Dark Pact is not in the beta tables (WoW Forever Guides ).", "At launch (Blizzard notes of 3 Nov): demons get 2 health per point of your Stamina instead of 7.5 (a less sturdy Voidwalker), Wrack deals more (86 per second at 60), Shadow and Flame up to 20%, Spellstones raise only Shadow damage, and Drain Soul gives a Soul Shard much less often when the mob does not die." },
   races = { ["human"] = "Human (Alliance): Ruthless (+crit, 2% according to Method), The Human Spirit (+Spirit, scales Life Tap), Will to Survive, Perception. Method: tier S. Sword Specialization was removed (the Warcraft Tavern guide is outdated on this).", ["gnome"] = "Gnome (Alliance): Expansive Mind (+5% mana), Eureka! (10% mana and +10% damage on non-periodic spells for 8 s: useless for Affliction), Escape Artist, Engineering Specialization. Method: tier B, the weakest for Affliction.", ["orc"] = "Orc (Horde): Command (+5% Pet damage, Warcraft Tavern ), Blood Fury (+Spell Power), Shatter Curse (removes Curse/Bane and reduces Magic damage), Hardiness (20% stun duration). Method: tier A; Maxroll recommends the Orc as Horde.", ["undead"] = "Undead (Horde): Cannibalize (7% HP+MP per second for 10 s on Humanoid/Undead corpses : less food/drink), Touch of the Grave (damage that heals you, including the DoTs' initial hit), Will of the Forsaken (removes Fear/Charm/Sleep, not immune), Underwater Breathing. Method: tier B, great for self-sustain.", ["troll"] = "Troll (Horde, new Warlock ): Berserking (+10% haste, doesn't apply to DoTs), Rapid Regeneration (channel that heals, great with Life Tap), Regeneration (HP regen in combat), Beast Slaying (+5% damage to Beasts, useful in the Barrens). Method: tier C. Starts in the Valley of Trials like the Orc." },
   spells = { { 1, "Demon Skin", "spell_shadow_ragingscream", "Armor buff (+40) and +3 HP/5 s for 30 min: keep it always up (Demon Armor from 20).", false }, { 1, "Summon Imp", "spell_shadow_summonimp", "The first demon, from the racial class quest (level 1–4). Firebolt at range and Blood Pact from 4 (Stamina to the group).", false }, { 1, "Shadow Bolt", "spell_shadow_shadowbolt", "Rank 2 at 6, Rank 3 at 12, Rank 4 at 20, Rank 5 at 28, Rank 6 at 36. Expensive: before 14 use the Wand.", false }, { 1, "Immolate", "spell_fire_immolation", "From the Trainer for 10 copper: learn it right away. Rank 2 at 10, Rank 3 at 20, Rank 4 at 30. Only on mobs that live >8 s.", false }, { 4, "Corruption", "spell_shadow_abominationexplosion", "Shadow DoT 12 s, 2 s cast until Improved Corruption 5/5 (14). Rank 2 at 14, Rank 3 at 24, Rank 4 at 34.", false }, { 4, "Curse of Weakness", "spell_shadow_curseofmannoroth", "Reduces attack power: useful against melee mobs that hit hard. Rank 2 at 12, Rank 3 at 22.", false }, { 6, "Life Tap", "spell_shadow_burningspirit", "Converts HP into Mana (30 + Spirit): Spirit really matters. Rank 2 at 16, Rank 3 at 26.", false }, { 8, "Bane of Agony", "spell_shadow_curseofsargeras", "Replaces Curse of Agony: instant, tags the mob and does little damage at first (the demon takes the threat). 72 dmg in 24 s; Rank 2 at 18, Rank 3 at 28.", false }, { 8, "Fear", "spell_shadow_possession", "Range 20 yd (was 24 in beta). 10 s, 1 target, damage can break it. Rank 2 at 32.", false }, { 10, "Drain Soul", "spell_shadow_haunting", "Each tick has a chance to give a Soul Shard; a non-trivial mob killed with Drain Soul always gives a shard. Rank 2 at 24.", false }, { 10, "Create Healthstone", "inv_stone_04", "Emergency heal (Minor: 120 HP) with its own cooldown. Costs a Soul Shard. Rank 2 at 22, Rank 3 at 34.", false }, { 10, "Summon Voidwalker", "spell_shadow_summonvoidwalker", "Level 10 class quest (see Milestones). Torment/Suffering/Sacrifice: your tank.", false }, { 12, "Health Funnel", "spell_shadow_lifedrain", "Channels HP to the demon. With Demonic Energies you'll use less of it.", false }, { 14, "Drain Life", "spell_shadow_lifedrain02", "Channeled 5 s: 10 HP/s from the target (Rank 2 at 22, Rank 3 at 30 = drain tanking Rank).", false }, { 14, "Curse of Recklessness", "spell_shadow_unholystrength", "Less armor and the mob doesn't flee at low HP. Rank 2 at 28. Now it's a Curse (one per Warlock, in addition to Bane).", false }, { 16, "Unending Breath", "spell_shadow_demonbreath", "Underwater breathing for 10 min: needed for underwater quests.", false }, { 18, "Searing Pain", "spell_fire_soulburn", "Short cast, high threat. Only for Demonology with Demonic Brand; otherwise it takes the mob off your demon.", false }, { 18, "Create Soulstone", "inv_misc_orb_04", "In-combat resurrection on yourself or an ally (Rank 2 at 30).", false }, { 20, "Summon Succubus", "spell_shadow_summonsuccubus", "Level 20 class quest: the demon that does the most damage (~1,5× Voidwalker). Without Demonology talents it doesn't hold threat.", false }, { 20, "Summon Incubus", "ability_warlock_incubus", "Male version of the Succubus with its own quest chain (same abilities).", false }, { 20, "Demon Armor", "spell_shadow_ragingscream", "Improved version of Demon Skin (Rank 2 at 30, Rank 3 at 40).", false }, { 20, "Ritual of Summoning", "spell_shadow_twilight", "The only way to summon players: needs 2 companions and 1 Soul Shard (the Meeting Stone no longer summons).", false }, { 20, "Curse of the Elements", "warlock_curse_shadow", "30 Magic resistance and +4% Magic damage taken for 5 min (Rank 2 at 30). The client gives it at 20 (Classic: 32) .", false }, { 20, "Rain of Fire", "spell_shadow_rainoffire", "Channeled AoE, the only one with true area damage (Rank 2 at 34).", false }, { 22, "Eye of Kilrogg", "spell_shadow_evileye", "Flying exploration eye.", false }, { 24, "Drain Mana", "spell_shadow_siphonmana", "Drains mana from casters (Rank 2 at 34).", false }, { 24, "Sense Demons", "spell_shadow_metamorphosis", "Tracks demons on the minimap.", false }, { 26, "Curse of Tongues", "spell_shadow_curseoftounges", "Slows casters' casting (Rank 2 at 50).", false }, { 26, "Detect Invisibility", "spell_shadow_detectinvisibility", "See invisible mobs (Rank 2 at 38).", false }, { 28, "Banish", "spell_shadow_cripple", "Removes a Demon or Elemental from combat; damage doesn't interrupt it.", false }, { 28, "Create Firestone", "inv_misc_gem_bloodstone_02", "Fire weapon stone; for Destruction/Demonology.", false }, { 30, "Summon Felhunter", "spell_shadow_summonfelhunter", "Level 30 class quest (Seeking Strahad, Ratchet). Spell Lock (36), Devour Magic.", false }, { 30, "Subjugate Demon", "spell_shadow_enslavedemon", "(was Enslave Demon) Controls a demon up to level 45; costs 1 Soul Shard.", false }, { 30, "Hellfire", "spell_fire_incinerate", "AoE around you that also damages you: manage your HP.", false }, { 30, "Siphon Life", "spell_shadow_requiem", "Affliction talent-spell (150 mana, 30 yd, 30 s): heals 11 HP every 3 s. Unlocked by the talent.", false }, { 30, "Siphon Life", "spell_shadow_requiem", "DoT that heals you; use it on mobs that live at least 2/3 of its duration (Warcraft Tavern).", true }, { 32, "Shadow Ward", "spell_shadow_antishadow", "Absorbs Shadow damage (Rank 2 at 42).", false }, { 36, "Create Spellstone", "inv_misc_gem_sapphire_01", "Weapon stone: Spell Haste and Shadow damage (Maxroll).", false }, { 40, "Summon Felsteed", "spell_nature_swiftness", "Mount from class quest (Trainer in capital -> Strahad Farsan, Ratchet).", false }, { 40, "Wrack", "ability_deathknight_hemorrhagicfever", "Capstone Affliction, channeled 6 s.", false }, { 40, "Howl of Terror", "spell_shadow_deathscream", "AoE Fear.", false }, { 40, "Wrack", "ability_deathknight_hemorrhagicfever", "6 sec channel: 60 Shadow per second and your DoTs tick twice as fast. From 40 it is the filler after your DoTs.", true }, { 42, "Death Coil", "spell_shadow_deathcoil", "Instant escape: the target flees and it heals you for the damage dealt.", false }, { 48, "Soul Fire", "spell_fire_fireball02", "Long cast, high damage (Decimation makes it free). Rank 2 at 56.", false }, { 50, "Inferno", "spell_shadow_summoninfernal", "Level 50 class quest: Infernal (Niby the Almighty, Felwood).", false }, { 51, "Demonic Sacrifice", "spell_shadow_psychicscream", "Sacrifice your Imp: +15% Shadow damage for 2 hours. Summoning a demon cancels it.", true }, { 52, "Amplify Curse", "spell_shadow_contagion", "Next Curse of Weakness or Bane of Agony +50%: spend it before a long pull.", true }, { 53, "Curse of Exhaustion", "spell_shadow_grimward", "30% slow for 12 sec, the Warlock's only slow.", true }, { 60, "Bane of Doom", "spell_shadow_auraofdarkness", "New Bane from 60; Ritual of Doom and Dreadsteed from 60 (post-launch).", false } },
   bsp = { b = { { 1, "Demon Skin", "spell_shadow_ragingscream", "Armor buff (+40) and +3 HP/5 s for 30 min: keep it always up (Demon Armor from 20).", false }, { 1, "Summon Imp", "spell_shadow_summonimp", "The first demon, from the racial class quest (level 1–4). Firebolt at range and Blood Pact from 4 (Stamina to the group).", false }, { 1, "Shadow Bolt", "spell_shadow_shadowbolt", "Rank 2 at 6, Rank 3 at 12, Rank 4 at 20, Rank 5 at 28, Rank 6 at 36. Expensive: before 14 use the Wand.", false }, { 1, "Immolate", "spell_fire_immolation", "From the Trainer for 10 copper: learn it right away. Rank 2 at 10, Rank 3 at 20, Rank 4 at 30. Only on mobs that live >8 s.", false }, { 4, "Corruption", "spell_shadow_abominationexplosion", "Shadow DoT 12 s, 2 s cast until Improved Corruption 5/5 (14). Rank 2 at 14, Rank 3 at 24, Rank 4 at 34.", false }, { 4, "Curse of Weakness", "spell_shadow_curseofmannoroth", "Reduces attack power: useful against melee mobs that hit hard. Rank 2 at 12, Rank 3 at 22.", false }, { 6, "Life Tap", "spell_shadow_burningspirit", "Converts HP into Mana (30 + Spirit): Spirit really matters. Rank 2 at 16, Rank 3 at 26.", false }, { 8, "Bane of Agony", "spell_shadow_curseofsargeras", "Replaces Curse of Agony: instant, tags the mob and does little damage at first (the demon takes the threat). 72 dmg in 24 s; Rank 2 at 18, Rank 3 at 28.", false }, { 8, "Fear", "spell_shadow_possession", "Range 20 yd (was 24 in beta). 10 s, 1 target, damage can break it. Rank 2 at 32.", false }, { 10, "Drain Soul", "spell_shadow_haunting", "Each tick has a chance to give a Soul Shard; a non-trivial mob killed with Drain Soul always gives a shard. Rank 2 at 24.", false }, { 10, "Create Healthstone", "inv_stone_04", "Emergency heal (Minor: 120 HP) with its own cooldown. Costs a Soul Shard. Rank 2 at 22, Rank 3 at 34.", false }, { 10, "Summon Voidwalker", "spell_shadow_summonvoidwalker", "Level 10 class quest (see Milestones). Torment/Suffering/Sacrifice: your tank.", false }