he target flees and it heals you for the damage dealt.", false }, { 48, "Soul Fire", "spell_fire_fireball02", "Long cast, high damage (Decimation makes it free). Rank 2 at 56.", false }, { 50, "Inferno", "spell_shadow_summoninfernal", "Level 50 class quest: Infernal (Niby the Almighty, Felwood).", false }, { 60, "Bane of Doom", "spell_shadow_auraofdarkness", "New Bane from 60; Ritual of Doom and Dreadsteed from 60 (post-launch).", false } }, c = { { 1, "Demon Skin", "spell_shadow_ragingscream", "Armor buff (+40) and +3 HP/5 s for 30 min: keep it always up (Demon Armor from 20).", false }, { 1, "Summon Imp", "spell_shadow_summonimp", "The first demon, from the racial class quest (level 1–4). Firebolt at range and Blood Pact from 4 (Stamina to the group).", false }, { 1, "Shadow Bolt", "spell_shadow_shadowbolt", "Rank 2 at 6, Rank 3 at 12, Rank 4 at 20, Rank 5 at 28, Rank 6 at 36. Expensive: before 14 use the Wand.", false }, { 1, "Immolate", "spell_fire_immolation", "From the Trainer for 10 copper: learn it right away. Rank 2 at 10, Rank 3 at 20, Rank 4 at 30. Only on mobs that live >8 s.", false }, { 4, "Corruption", "spell_shadow_abominationexplosion", "Shadow DoT 12 s, 2 s cast until Improved Corruption 5/5 (14). Rank 2 at 14, Rank 3 at 24, Rank 4 at 34.", false }, { 4, "Curse of Weakness", "spell_shadow_curseofmannoroth", "Reduces attack power: useful against melee mobs that hit hard. Rank 2 at 12, Rank 3 at 22.", false }, { 6, "Life Tap", "spell_shadow_burningspirit", "Converts HP into Mana (30 + Spirit): Spirit really matters. Rank 2 at 16, Rank 3 at 26.", false }, { 8, "Bane of Agony", "spell_shadow_curseofsargeras", "Replaces Curse of Agony: instant, tags the mob and does little damage at first (the demon takes the threat). 72 dmg in 24 s; Rank 2 at 18, Rank 3 at 28.", false }, { 8, "Fear", "spell_shadow_possession", "Range 20 yd (was 24 in beta). 10 s, 1 target, damage can break it. Rank 2 at 32.", false }, { 10, "Drain Soul", "spell_shadow_haunting", "Each tick has a chance to give a Soul Shard; a non-trivial mob killed with Drain Soul always gives a shard. Rank 2 at 24.", false }, { 10, "Create Healthstone", "inv_stone_04", "Emergency heal (Minor: 120 HP) with its own cooldown. Costs a Soul Shard. Rank 2 at 22, Rank 3 at 34.", false }, { 10, "Summon Voidwalker", "spell_shadow_summonvoidwalker", "Level 10 class quest (see Milestones). Torment/Suffering/Sacrifice: your tank.", false }, { 12, "Health Funnel", "spell_shadow_lifedrain", "Channels HP to the demon. With Demonic Energies you'll use less of it.", false }, { 14, "Drain Life", "spell_shadow_lifedrain02", "Channeled 5 s: 10 HP/s from the target (Rank 2 at 22, Rank 3 at 30 = drain tanking Rank).", false }, { 14, "Curse of Recklessness", "spell_shadow_unholystrength", "Less armor and the mob doesn't flee at low HP. Rank 2 at 28. Now it's a Curse (one per Warlock, in addition to Bane).", false }, { 16, "Unending Breath", "spell_shadow_demonbreath", "Underwater breathing for 10 min: needed for underwater quests.", false }, { 18, "Searing Pain", "spell_fire_soulburn", "Short cast, high threat. Only for Demonology with Demonic Brand; otherwise it takes the mob off your demon.", false }, { 18, "Create Soulstone", "inv_misc_orb_04", "In-combat resurrection on yourself or an ally (Rank 2 at 30).", false }, { 20, "Summon Succubus", "spell_shadow_summonsuccubus", "Level 20 class quest: the demon that does the most damage (~1,5× Voidwalker). Without Demonology talents it doesn't hold threat.", false }, { 20, "Summon Incubus", "ability_warlock_incubus", "Male version of the Succubus with its own quest chain (same abilities).", false }, { 20, "Demon Armor", "spell_shadow_ragingscream", "Improved version of Demon Skin (Rank 2 at 30, Rank 3 at 40).", false }, { 20, "Ritual of Summoning", "spell_shadow_twilight", "The only way to summon players: needs 2 companions and 1 Soul Shard (the Meeting Stone no longer summons).", false }, { 20, "Curse of the Elements", "warlock_curse_shadow", "30 Magic resistance and +4% Magic damage taken for 5 min (Rank 2 at 30). The client gives it at 20 (Classic: 32) .", false }, { 20, "Rain of Fire", "spell_shadow_rainoffire", "Channeled AoE, the only one with true area damage (Rank 2 at 34).", false }, { 22, "Eye of Kilrogg", "spell_shadow_evileye", "Flying exploration eye.", false }, { 24, "Drain Mana", "spell_shadow_siphonmana", "Drains mana from casters (Rank 2 at 34).", false }, { 24, "Sense Demons", "spell_shadow_metamorphosis", "Tracks demons on the minimap.", false }, { 26, "Curse of Tongues", "spell_shadow_curseoftounges", "Slows casters' casting (Rank 2 at 50).", false }, { 26, "Detect Invisibility", "spell_shadow_detectinvisibility", "See invisible mobs (Rank 2 at 38).", false }, { 28, "Banish", "spell_shadow_cripple", "Removes a Demon or Elemental from combat; damage doesn't interrupt it.", false }, { 28, "Create Firestone", "inv_misc_gem_bloodstone_02", "Fire weapon stone; for Destruction/Demonology.", false }, { 30, "Summon Felhunter", "spell_shadow_summonfelhunter", "Level 30 class quest (Seeking Strahad, Ratchet). Spell Lock (36), Devour Magic.", false }, { 30, "Subjugate Demon", "spell_shadow_enslavedemon", "(was Enslave Demon) Controls a demon up to level 45; costs 1 Soul Shard.", false }, { 30, "Hellfire", "spell_fire_incinerate", "AoE around you that also damages you: manage your HP.", false }, { 30, "Siphon Life", "spell_shadow_requiem", "Affliction talent-spell (150 mana, 30 yd, 30 s): heals 11 HP every 3 s. Unlocked by the talent.", false }, { 32, "Shadow Ward", "spell_shadow_antishadow", "Absorbs Shadow damage (Rank 2 at 42).", false }, { 36, "Create Spellstone", "inv_misc_gem_sapphire_01", "Weapon stone: Spell Haste and Shadow damage (Maxroll).", false }, { 40, "Summon Felsteed", "spell_nature_swiftness", "Mount from class quest (Trainer in capital -> Strahad Farsan, Ratchet).", false }, { 40, "Wrack", "ability_deathknight_hemorrhagicfever", "Capstone Affliction, channeled 6 s.", false }, { 40, "Howl of Terror", "spell_shadow_deathscream", "AoE Fear.", false }, { 41, "Siphon Life", "spell_shadow_requiem", "DoT that heals you; use it on mobs that live at least 2/3 of its duration (Warcraft Tavern).", true }, { 42, "Death Coil", "spell_shadow_deathcoil", "Instant escape: the target flees and it heals you for the damage dealt.", false }, { 48, "Soul Fire", "spell_fire_fireball02", "Long cast, high damage (Decimation makes it free). Rank 2 at 56.", false }, { 50, "Inferno", "spell_shadow_summoninfernal", "Level 50 class quest: Infernal (Niby the Almighty, Felwood).", false }, { 60, "Bane of Doom", "spell_shadow_auraofdarkness", "New Bane from 60; Ritual of Doom and Dreadsteed from 60 (post-launch).", false } } } },
  warrior = { why = { ["Shield Specialization"] = "+5% Block and 5 Rage per Block: this is the build's whole Rage economy, so it goes to 5/5 first (Method, Icy Veins, wowforever.be).", ["Improved Revenge"] = "+60% Revenge damage (14+), your main ability in Defensive Stance after block/dodge/parry.", ["Improved Thunder Clap"] = "-6 Rage cost (Thunder Clap base 20 Rage): makes Thunder Clap sustainable against packs and strong mobs.", ["Master of Defense"] = "5 Rage per Dodge/Parry with a shield: second source of Rage from hits taken (requires Shield Specialization).", ["Improved Bloodrage"] = "+50% Rage from Bloodrage at 2/2: more Rage at the start of a pull.", ["Vanguard"] = "Charge usable in Defensive Stance: no more stance dancing to open the pull (before 25 stay in Defensive to avoid losing Rage).", ["Defiance"] = "Extra threat in Defensive Stance with shield: mainly needed in dungeons; solo it's the weakest point (see doubts).", ["Improved Sunder Armor"] = "-3 Rage on Sunder Armor (3/3 by 57): Sunder cheaper for threat and group damage.", ["Concussion Blow"] = "5 s stun (45 s CD, 10 Rage): solo panic button and prerequisite for Shield Slam.", ["Focused Rage"] = "-3 Rage on all offensive abilities: more damage for the same Rage, fixed step at 31–33.", ["Bastion"] = "+10% to all damage dealt with a shield equipped (5/5): the build's real DPS increase.", ["Shield Slam"] = "Second strong ability (from 40, 6 s CD, damage + Block Value, very high threat): Icy Veins says leveling speeds up here.", ["Cruelty"] = "+5% crit at 5/5 (41–45): first step toward Fury/Dual Spec after 40.", ["Deflection"] = "+5% Parry (46–50): bridge toward Improved Tactical Mastery and Anger Management.", ["Improved Tactical Mastery"] = "Up to 25 Rage kept when switching Stance (10 base + 15): cheaper stance dance.", ["Anger Management"] = "1 Rage every 3 s in combat and -30% Rage lost out of combat.", ["Improved Charge"] = "+6 Rage from Charge (2/2): richer pull opener.", ["Unbridled Wrath"] = "60% chance to gain 1 extra Rage per weapon hit (5 points): extra Rage from auto-attacks.", ["Improved Overpower"] = "+50% Overpower crit (54–55): a bridge to Anger Management, as in wowforever.gg’s Protection build (3 Nov).", ["Improved Rend"] = "+35% Rend damage (3/3): the two-handed Warrior's first DoT (Ahlaundoh, 10–12).", ["Deep Wounds"] = "Your crits make the target bleed (60% of your weapon's average damage over 12 s): extra damage without Rage.", ["Spearing Strike"] = "Attack for 75% weapon damage, +75% against Giants, Dragonkin and mounted targets (Ahlaundoh at 25).", ["Two-Handed Weapon Specialization"] = "+6% damage with two-handed weapons (3/3): the base of the Arms build.", ["Impale"] = "+20% to the crit bonus of your abilities (2/2): Mortal Strike and Overpower hit harder.", ["Sweeping Strikes"] = "Your next 5 melee attacks also hit a second nearby mob: for two-mob pulls (30).", ["Last Stand"] = "Active: +30% of your maximum health for 20 sec, then you lose it; 3 min cooldown. Saves pulls gone wrong.", ["Improved Shield Wall"] = "Shortens the cooldown of Shield Wall (2 ranks): you have it more often for big pulls.", ["Lingering Rage"] = "Out of combat your Rage starts decaying 10 sec later (at 5/5): you reach the next pull with Rage.", ["Enrage"] = "When you take a hit you have a 30% chance to deal +10% Physical damage for 12 sec (at 5/5): with a shield you get hit often, so it is almost always up." },
   summary = "Protection (one-hand + shield) is the most recommended solo spec: the most saved Warrior guide on Mobalytics is a Protection guide (KallTorak, 214 ), Icy Veins calls it \"the fastest Warrior spec for leveling\" and recommends it (snippet), Zockify (Oct 28) rates it strongest up to ~40, and wowforever.be (client 1.60.1.70707) builds its whole 10–40 route on Protection. The 10–60 order is the «Protection 1-60» of Ahlaundoh, the most voted Warrior guide (473 ). Conditions: Revenge uses block/dodge/parry, Shield Specialization and Master of Defense give Rage from hits taken, and it is safe in packs. Arms (two-hand) stays the choice for group/duo (Method, Icy Veins, Mobalytics Ahlaundoh 473 , updated Nov 17); Fury does not take off before 36–40.", bsum = { b = "Group or duo with a healer, dungeons and high single-target damage: the choice Method and Icy Veins give for groups." }, rot = { { "1–9 · Battle Stance, Rage from auto-attacks", { { "ability_warrior_battleshout", "Battle Shout" }, { "ability_warrior_charge", "Charge (4)" }, { "ability_gouge", "Rend (4)" }, { "ability_rogue_ambush", "Heroic Strike" }, { "ability_shockwave", "Hamstring (8)" } }, "Battle Shout, Charge to open (9 Rage), Rend if the mob lives at least a few ticks, then Heroic Strike with excess Rage. Thunder Clap (6) on packs, Hamstring (8) to escape. Rage comes from weapon speed, not damage: slow and heavy weapon = more Rage per hit (Warcraft Tavern, Kami)." }, { "10–19 · Defensive Stance, shield, Revenge", { { "ability_warrior_defensivestance", "Defensive Stance" }, { "ability_defend", "Shield Block (16)" }, { "ability_warrior_revenge", "Revenge (14)" }, { "ability_warrior_sunder", "Sunder Armor" }, { "spell_nature_thunderclap", "Thunder Clap" }, { "ability_rogue_ambush", "Heroic Strike" } }, "After the class quest (10) switch to 1H + shield. Open with Charge in Battle Stance (stance dance, Tactical Mastery at 14 keeps up to 10 Rage) or without Charge in Defensive until you have Vanguard. Shield Block (16) -> Revenge as soon as it procs -> Sunder Armor or Thunder Clap -> Heroic Strike with excess Rage. With Shield Specialization every Block gives 5 Rage." }, { "20–39 · Revenge + Victory Rush + Concussion Blow", { { "ability_warrior_charge", "Charge (from 25 in Defensive)" }, { "ability_defend", "Shield Block" }, { "ability_warrior_revenge", "Revenge" }, { "ability_warrior_devastate", "Victory Rush" }, { "ability_warrior_cleave", "Cleave (2+)" }, { "ability_thunderbolt", "Concussion Blow (30)" } }, "From 25 (Vanguard) open with Charge without leaving Defensive. Cycle: Shield Block -> Revenge -> Sunder Armor/Thunder Clap -> Heroic Strike. As soon as a mob dies, use Victory Rush on the next one (heals 10%). Execute (24) requires Battle/Berserker Stance: in Protection the Stance switch usually isn't worth it ( my assessment, no source says so). Concussion Blow (30) as an emergency stun." }, { "40+ · Shield Slam", { { "ability_defend", "Shield Block" }, { "ability_warrior_devastate", "Victory Rush (<90%)" }, { "ability_warrior_revenge", "Revenge" }, { "inv_shield_05", "Shield Slam" }, { "ability_warrior_warcry", "Demoralizing Shout" }, { "ability_rogue_ambush", "Heroic Strike (60+ Rage)" } }, "Stay in Defensive Stance (entering Defensive sets your Rage to 10: spend it first) with Battle Shout up. Shield Block whenever you can: with Shield Specialization it is nearly free and it triggers Revenge. Victory Rush when you are below 90% health, Revenge whenever it is up, Shield Slam on cooldown, Demoralizing Shout always on the mob, then Rend and Thunder Clap. Heroic Strike only above 60 Rage. Berserker Rage before the pull or against a Fear (Mobalytics – Ahlaundoh, Nov 13)." }, { "AoE / multiple pulls", { { "ability_warrior_warcry", "Demoralizing Shout" }, { "spell_nature_thunderclap", "Thunder Clap" }, { "ability_warrior_revenge", "Revenge" }, { "ability_warrior_cleave", "Cleave" }, { "ability_warrior_shieldwall", "Shield Wall (28)" } }, "Protection is the spec that handles packs best (Warcraft Tavern, Zockify): Demoralizing Shout (14) + Thunder Clap (-20% attack speed, 4 targets), then Revenge and Cleave (20) instead of Heroic Strike. Cooldowns to pull more: Intimidating Shout (22), Retaliation, Shield Wall (28), Last Stand (22)." } },
   brot = { b = { { "Single target", { { "ability_meleedamage", "Overpower" }, { "ability_warrior_savageblow", "Mortal Strike (40)" } }, "Overpower when available; Mortal Strike from 40 (Icy Veins, Mobalytics). Rotation details not read in the sources ." }, { "Two targets", { { "ability_warrior_cleave", "Sweeping Strikes" } }, "Sweeping Strikes on packs of 2 targets (Maxroll, Warcraft Tavern)." } } },
   notes = { { "Rage and downtime", "• Normalized Rage: hits give Rage based on weapon speed and not damage, and armor no longer reduces the Rage from damage taken (Oct 8 build). Crits give +100% Rage.\n• Anger Management (56) and Unbridled Wrath (60) arrive late in the wowforever.be build; before 30 the Rage comes from Block, Dodge/Parry, Bloodrage and Charge.\n• The Warrior has no heal: {Victory Rush} (20+), First Aid bandages between pulls, Cooking for the XP buff. Advice shared by Maxroll, Method and Zockify.\n• Don't spend all your Rage on Execute if the mob has low HP: save it for the next one (Warcraft Tavern)." }, { "Stance", "• {Battle:} Charge, Overpower, Execute, Mocking Blow, Retaliation. {Defensive:} Revenge, Shield Block, Disarm, Taunt. {Berserker (30):} Whirlwind, Pummel, Intercept, Berserker Rage.\n• Maxroll: stay in Battle Stance before Improved Tactical Mastery and in Defensive before Vanguard (switching for Charge brings you to 10 Rage)." }, { "Kiting and escape", "Hamstring (8) and Intimidating Shout (22) to get out of wrong pulls, Shield Bash/Pummel for casters. Discouraged by most guides: pulling more mobs than you should before having Shield Block." } }, stats = "Leveling priority (Warcraft Tavern): Weapon DPS -> Strength/Attack Power -> Stamina -> Agility -> Armor. Protection: 1H + shield; wear the highest armor possible while meeting Strength/Stamina (Maxroll). 1H weapons (Zockify): Alliance Durgen's Crescent Axe (13), Cruel Barb (19), Hamhock's Cleaver (25); Horde Thick War Axe (12, crafted), Hammer of Orgrimmar (quest 16), Wingblade (quest 22); then Pronged Reaver (30), Glutton's Cleaver (37), Thrash Blade (quest 51). Shields: Welding Shield (quest 16), Commander's Crest (21), Bonepile Gaze (28), Aegis of the Scarlet Commander (39), Stoneshell Guard (47), Draconian Deflector (58). 2H for Arms: Copper Battle Axe (8, crafted), Corpse Chopper (16), Strike of the Hydra (26), Corpsemaker (29), Whirlwind Axe (quest 40). How to get individual items: not found (Zockify only gives level/type). Dungeons to chase (Maxroll, recommended level): Hall of Thanes 13–18, Ragefire Chasm 13–18, Ruins of Lordaeron 15–20, Shadowfang Keep 17–22, Deadmines and Wailing Caverns 18–23, Stockade and City of Dalaran 25–30, Blackfathom Deeps and Scarlet Monastery Graveyard 27–32, Gnomeregan 29–34, Excavation Site: Wetlands 31–36 (the Forever client says 26–31 from Oct 1).", forever = { "Normalized Rage: Rage from hits by weapon speed and not damage; armor no longer reduces the Rage from damage taken, crits +100% Rage (Kami Sep 30; Blizzard Oct 1/8).", "Protection: Shield Specialization gives 5 Rage per Block and 100% chance; Master of Defense, Vanguard and Focused Rage are new; Bastion +10% damage with shield; Shield Block blocks 2 attacks for 7 s (Kami Sep 30).", "From Sep 24, Bastion and Focused Rage swapped rows; from Oct 1 Iron Will, Anticipation and Improved Bloodrage are in the first two rows and Toughness was removed (Blizzard notes).", "Tactical Mastery and Victory Rush (20) are base spells; Berserker Rage at 30 (was 32); Slam at 20; Battle Shout raid-wide from Oct 15 (Blizzard / wowforever.be).", "New Arms talents: Spearing Strike (from Oct 1 no 2H, requires Battle Stance), Bloodthrill (2 ranks since 3 Nov, 10–20%, Main Hand only), Weaponmaster; Fury: Lingering Rage, Furious Precision, Gore Drinker (Oct 1), Reckless Swings and Improved Whirlwind (3 Nov, replacing Raging Blows).", "Oct 8: Rage from warrior quests rebalanced (about 20–40% per level); Demoralizing Shout generates threat; Oct 16: Overpower works on much lower-level mobs, Slam doesn't suffer pushback.", "Dual Talent Specialization at level 40 (wowforever.be, Warcraft Tavern). Zephras Isle has new Warrior Trainers (Warcraft Tavern).", "Server hotfix on Oct 30 (216 talents/spells touched, unverified aggregator): impossible to know whether they affect Warrior; re-check the tooltips in-game.", "At launch (Blizzard notes of 3 Nov): Defensive Stance +80% threat (was 30%), Defiance up to 20%, Two-Handed Weapon Specialization 2/4/6%, Slam 15 sec cooldown; Improved Tactical Mastery now 3 ranks (5/10/15 Rage), Flurry 3 ranks and no longer needs Death Wish, Bloodthirst needs Death Wish, Enrage in row 3." },
   races = { ["human"] = "Ruthless +1% crit to everything (Warcraft Tavern; in the Oct 16 notes it was +2%), Will to Survive removes every stun, Perception, The Human Spirit +10% Spirit (little for Warrior). No more Sword/Mace Specialization.", ["dwarf"] = "Stoneform (3 min, -10% physical damage for 8 s and cleanse of bleed/poison/disease), Artisan's Precision +1% Hit, Big Game Hunter +5% damage to Beasts (great in outdoor quests), Find Treasure. Mobalytics (snippet) recommends Dwarf for Alliance Warriors until 30 .", ["gnome"] = "Escape Artist (removes slow/root + 3 s immunity), Eureka! (8 s: reduced costs and +10% damage), Expansive Mind +5% max Rage (little use with normalized Rage), Engineering Specialization (-20% backfire).", ["nightelf"] = "Quickness: +1% Dodge (helps Revenge and Master of Defense) and +2% speed; Elune's Light +10% crit for 15 s (3 min CD); Shadowmeld now also reduces threat (2 min CD); Wisp Spirit.", ["skyborne_a"] = "High Order: Wind Blessed +2% Haste, Elemental Insight +5% damage to Elementals, Walk on Air (90 s CD, slow fall), Read Ley Line (+50% HP/mana regen for 15 s, 2 min CD, 100% if Attuned). Maxroll recommends both Skyborne races.", ["orc"] = "Blood Fury +10% Attack Power/Spell Power for 15 s (tooltip: 2 min CD; Oct 16 notes: 3 min ), Hardiness -20% stun duration, Shatter Curse, Command (useless). Savage removed.", ["troll"] = "Berserking +10% attack/cast speed for 15 s (3 min CD; nerf from Classic's 30%), Beast Slaying +5% damage to Beasts, Regeneration (20% from Oct 16 ), Rapid Regeneration (channeled).", ["tauren"] = "Endurance +5% Health (useful for tanks), War Stomp (0,5 s cast, 2 s stun on 5 enemies at 8 yd, 90 s CD), Plainsrunning up to +30% speed after 150 s of running and +3% mount, Cultivation (herbalism).", ["undead"] = "Will of the Forsaken (2 min CD, removes Charm/Fear/Sleep), Cannibalize (7% HP and mana every 2 s for 10 s from Humanoid/Undead corpses: free heal), Touch of the Grave (30% chance to drain up to 5% max HP, 15 s CD), Underwater Breathing.", ["skyborne_h"] = "Windshaper: Wind Blessed, Elemental Insight, Walk on Air and Skysight (+15% speed 15 s, 30% if Charged, 2 min CD) instead of Read Ley Line." },
   spells = { { 1, "Battle Shout", "ability_warrior_battleshout", "Attack Power buff for the whole party/raid (3 min, 10 Rage). Raid-wide from Oct 15. Keep it always up.", false }, { 1, "Heroic Strike", "ability_rogue_ambush", "Extra hit on the next swing, spends excess Rage (15 Rage at Rank 1).", false }, { 4, "Rend", "ability_gouge", "Bleed (10 Rage) that ignores armor; don't use it on mobs that die right away. Used in Battle and Defensive Stance.", false }, { 4, "Charge", "ability_warrior_charge", "Charge + 1 s stun, generates 9 Rage (Rank 1); only out of combat, in Battle Stance (in Defensive after Vanguard at 25).", false }, { 6, "Thunder Clap", "spell_nature_thunderclap", "20 Rage, 20% attack speed on up to 4 enemies, 6 s CD: packs and strong mobs. Battle or Defensive.", false }, { 8, "Hamstring", "ability_shockwave", "-40% movement for 15 s: kiting and escaping wrong pulls.", false }, { 10, "Bloodrage", "ability_racial_bloodrage", "10 Rage immediately + 10 over 10 s at the cost of health (20% base HP), 1 min CD.", false }, { 10, "Sunder Armor", "ability_warrior_sunder", "Class quest at 10 (Defensive Stance, Taunt, Sunder Armor): -armor up to 5 stacks, high threat.", false }, { 10, "Defensive Stance", "ability_warrior_defensivestance", "Class quest: -10% damage taken and dealt, +30% threat; the base of the Protection build. Taunt (8 s CD) from the same quest.", false }, { 12, "Overpower", "ability_meleedamage", "Only after the target dodges, Battle Stance, 5 Rage. From Oct 16 it also works on mobs much lower level.", false }, { 12, "Shield Bash", "ability_warrior_shieldbash", "Interrupts a cast (10 Rage, 12 s CD), Battle or Defensive.", false }, { 14, "Revenge", "ability_warrior_revenge", "Defensive Stance only, after block/dodge/parry: 5 Rage, 5 s CD, your main damage in Protection.", false }, { 14, "Demoralizing Shout", "ability_warrior_warcry", "Reduces enemies' Attack Power within 10 yd (10 Rage). From Oct 8 it generates threat.", false }, { 14, "Tactical Mastery", "spell_nature_enchantarmor", "Now a base spell: keeps up to 10 Rage when switching Stance (Improved Tactical Mastery brings it to 25).", false }, { 16, "Shield Block", "ability_defend", "+75% Block for 7 s but only 2 attacks (Classic: 5 s, 1 attack). Defensive Stance, 10 Rage, 5 s CD: activates Revenge and gives Rage with Shield Specialization.", false }, { 16, "Mocking Blow", "ability_warrior_punishingblow", "Forces the target to attack you for 6 s (2 min CD, Battle Stance).", false }, { 18, "Disarm", "ability_warrior_disarm", "Disarms the enemy for 10 s (Defensive Stance, 1 min CD).", false }, { 20, "Slam", "ability_warrior_decisivestrike", "At 20 instead of Classic's 30: 1,5 s cast, 15 Rage, 18 s CD (Improved Slam in Arms). Little used in Protection.", false }, { 20, "Cleave", "ability_warrior_cleave", "Like Heroic Strike but hits a second target: spend it on 2+ mobs.", false }, { 20, "Victory Rush", "ability_warrior_devastate", "Base spell at 20: free attack after a kill (within 20 s) that heals 10% of max health. Essential for downtime.", false }, { 20, "Retaliation", "ability_warrior_challange", "Counterattacks every melee hit for 15 s (15 min CD, Battle Stance).", false }, { 20, "Dual Wield", "ability_dualwield", "Learned at 20 (Warcraft Tavern, Zockify): useless in Protection, needed for Fury.", false }, { 22, "Intimidating Shout", "ability_golemthunderclap", "Fear on up to 5 enemies (25 Rage, 3 min CD): emergency escape.", false }, { 22, "Last Stand", "spell_holy_ashestoashes", "Protection talent: +30% of your maximum health for 20 sec, then you lose it; 3 min cooldown.", true }, { 24, "Execute", "inv_sword_48", "Below 20% target health, Battle or Berserker Stance; don't spend all your Rage if the mob is about to die.", false }, { 25, "Vanguard", "ability_warrior_shieldcharge", "Charge usable in Defensive Stance: open pulls without changing Stance.", true }, { 26, "Challenging Shout", "ability_bullrush", "Forces nearby enemies to attack you for 6 s (10 min CD).", false }, { 28, "Shield Wall", "ability_warrior_shieldwall", "-60% damage taken for 12 s (Defensive Stance, 15 min base CD).", false }, { 30, "Berserker Stance", "ability_racial_avatar", "Class quest (see milestones): +3% crit, +10% damage taken. Berserker Rage at 30 (Classic: 32).", false }, { 30, "Berserker Rage", "spell_nature_ancestralguardian", "Immune to Fear and Incapacitate, extra Rage from damage taken (30 s CD, Berserker Stance).", false }, { 30, "Intercept", "ability_rogue_sprint", "Charge + 3 s stun (Berserker Stance, 10 Rage, 30 s CD).", false }, { 30, "Concussion Blow", "ability_thunderbolt", "5 s stun, 10 Rage, 45 s CD; required for Shield Slam.", true }, { 36, "Whirlwind", "ability_whirlwind", "Berserker Stance, 25 Rage, 10 s CD, hits up to 4 enemies (31–60).", false }, { 38, "Pummel", "inv_gauntlets_04", "Interrupt in Berserker Stance (31–60).", false }, { 40, "Shield Slam", "inv_shield_05", "Shield strike (damage + Block Value, 6 s CD, very high threat, 50% chance to dispel a magic effect).", true }, { 50, "Recklessness", "ability_criticalstrike", "+100% crit and immune to Fear for 15 s, +20% damage taken (31–60).", false } },
   bsp = { b = { { 1, "Battle Shout", "ability_warrior_battleshout", "Attack Power buff for the whole party/raid (3 min, 10 Rage). Raid-wide from Oct 15. Keep it always up.", false }, { 1, "Heroic Strike", "ability_rogue_ambush", "Extra hit on the next swing, spends excess Rage (15 Rage at Rank 1).", false }, { 4, "Rend", "ability_gouge", "Bleed (10 Rage) that ignores armor; don't use it on mobs that die right away. Used in Battle and Defensive Stance.", false }, { 4, "Charge", "ability_warrior_charge", "Charge + 1 s stun, generates 9 Rage (Rank 1); only out of combat, in Battle Stance (in Defensive after Vanguard at 25).", false }, { 6, "Thunder Clap", "spell_nature_thunderclap", "20 Rage, 20% attack speed on up to 4 enemies, 6 s CD: packs and strong mobs. Battle or Defensive.", false }, { 8, "Hamstring", "ability_shockwave", "-40% movement for 15 s: kiting and escaping wrong pulls.", false }, { 10, "Bloodrage", "ability_racial_bloodrage", "10 Rage immediately + 10 over 10 s at the cost of health (20% base HP), 1 min CD.", false }, { 10, "Sunder Armor", "ability_warrior_sunder", "Class quest at 10 (Defensive Stance, Taunt, Sunder Armor): -armor up to 5 stacks, high threat.", false }, { 10, "Defensive Stance", "ability_warrior_defensivestance", "Class quest: -10% damage taken and dealt, +30% threat; the base of the Protection build. Taunt (8 s CD) from the same quest.", false }, { 12, "Overpower", "ability_meleedamage", "Only after the target dodges, Battle Stance, 5 Rage. From Oct 16 it also works on mobs much lower level.", false }, { 12, "Shield Bash", "ability_warrior_shieldbash", "Interrupts a cast (10 Rage, 12 s CD), Battle or Defensive.", false }, { 14, "Revenge", "ability_warrior_revenge", "Defensive Stance only, after block/dodge/parry: 5 Rage, 5 s CD, your main damage in Protection.", false }, { 14, "Demoralizing Shout", "ability_warrior_warcry", "Reduces enemies' Attack Power within 10 yd (10 Rage). From Oct 8 it generates threat.", false }, { 14, "Tactical Mastery", "spell_nature_enchantarmor", "Now a base spell: keeps up to 10 Rage when switching Stance (Improved Tactical Mastery brings it to 25).", false }, { 16, "Shield Block", "ability_defend", "+75% Block for 7 s but only 2 attacks (Classic: 5 s, 1 attack). Defensive Stance, 10 Rage, 5 s CD: activates Revenge and gives Rage with Shield Specialization.", false }, { 16, "Mocking Blow", "ability_warrior_punishingblow", "Forces the target to attack you for 6 s (2 min CD, Battle Stance).", false }, { 18, "Disarm", "ability_warrior_disarm", "Disarms the enemy for 10 s (Defensive Stance, 1 min CD).", false }, { 20, "Slam", "ability_warrior_decisivestrike", "At 20 instead of Classic's 30: 1,5 s cast, 15 Rage, 18 s CD (Improved Slam in Arms). Little used in Protection.", false }, { 20, "Cleave", "ability_warrior_cleave", "Like Heroic Strike but hits a second target: spend it on 2+ mobs.", false }, { 20, "Victory Rush", "ability_warrior_devastate", "Base spell at 20: free attack after a kill (within 20 s) that heals 10% of max health. Essential for downtime.", false }, { 20, "Retaliation", "ability_warrior_challange", "Counterattacks every melee hit for 15 s (15 min CD, Battle Stance).", false }, { 20, "Dual Wield", "ability_dualwield", "Learned at 20 (Warcraft Tavern, Zockify): useless in Protection, needed for Fury.", false }, { 22, "Intimidating Shout", "ability_golemthunderclap", "Fear on up to 5 enemies (25 Rage, 3 min CD): emergency escape.", false }, { 24, "Execute", "inv_sword_48", "Below 20% target health, Battle or Berserker Stance; don't spend all your Rage if the mob is about to die.", false }, { 25, "Spearing Strike (talent)", "inv_spear_01", "", true }, { 26, "Challenging Shout", "ability_bullrush", "Forces nearby enemies to attack you for 6 s (10 min CD).", false }, { 28, "Shield Wall", "ability_warrior_shieldwall", "-60% damage taken for 12 s (Defensive Stance, 15 min base CD).", false }, { 30, "Berserker Stance", "ability_racial_avatar", "Class quest (see milestones): +3% crit, +10% damage taken. Berserker Rage at 30 (Classic: 32).", false }, { 30, "Berserker Rage", "spell_nature_ancestralguardian", "Immune to Fear and Incapacitate, extra Rage from damage taken (30 s CD, Berserker Stance).", false }, { 30, "Intercept", "ability_rogue_sprint", "Charge + 3 s stun (Berserker Stance, 10 Rage, 30 s CD).", false }, { 30, "Sweeping Strikes (talent)", "ability_rogue_slicedice", "", true }, { 36, "Whirlwind", "ability_whirlwind", "Berserker Stance, 25 Rage, 10 s CD, hits up to 4 enemies (31–60).", false }, { 38, "Pummel", "inv_gauntlets_04", "Interrupt in Berserker Stance (31–60).", false }, { 40, "Mortal Strike (talent)", "ability_warrior_savageblow", "", true }, { 50, "Recklessness", "ability_criticalstrike", "+100% crit and immune to Fear for 15 s, +20% damage taken (31–60).", false }, { 57, "Piercing Howl (talent)", "spell_shadow_deathscream", "", true }, { 58, "Reckless Swings (talent)", "ability_warrior_bloodfrenzy", "", true } } } },
  _races = { ["human"] = { "Human", { { "Will to Survive", "spell_shadow_charm", "New. Instant, 3 min cooldown: instantly removes all Stun effects." }, { "Perception", "spell_nature_sleep", "3 min cooldown: greatly increases stealth detection for 20 sec (including on mobs). Unchanged." }, { "Ruthless", "ability_rogue_eviscerate", "New (passive): +1% critical strike with all spells and attacks." }, { "The Human Spirit", "inv_enchant_shardbrilliantsmall", "Passive: Spirit +10%. Unchanged." } }, "Hunter is a new combination. Diplomacy is now a Legacy talent for all races; Sword and Mace Specialization are removed. Priest: Divine Grace and Feedback. The Book Bag (6 slots) comes from Marshal Dughan's chain in Goldshire." }, ["dwarf"] = { "Dwarf", { { "Stoneform", "spell_shadow_unholystrength", "Instant, 3 min cooldown: removes and grants immunity to Bleed, Poison and Disease and reduces Physical damage taken by 10% for 8 sec. changed (Classic: +armor)." }, { "Find Treasure", "racial_dwarf_findtreasure", "Tracking: shows treasures on the minimap and can increase chest loot; now stacks with other tracking. Lasts until you cancel it. + WT" }, { "Artisan's Precision", "inv_hammer_09", "New (passive): +1% Hit with all spells and attacks." }, { "Big Game Hunter", "inv_weapon_rifle_05", "New (passive): +5% damage vs Beasts." } }, "Shaman is a new combination, Dwarf only for the Alliance: there are totem quests (Warcraft Tavern: dwarf-shaman-totem-quests). Gun Specialization and Frost Resistance removed. Priest: Chastise and Desperate Prayer. Dun Morogh has no Flight Master: the first one is in Ironforge." }, ["gnome"] = { "Gnome", { { "Escape Artist", "ability_rogue_trip", "Instant, 2 min cooldown: frees you from every movement impairing effect and gives immunity for 3 sec." }, { "Eureka!", "inv_gnometoy", "New, instant, 2 min cooldown, for 8 sec: resource cost -10% and +10% damage (Mage: all damaging abilities; Warlock: non-periodic damaging; Priest: non-periodic damaging or healing). Varies by class." }, { "Expansive Mind", "inv_enchant_essenceeternallarge", "Changed (passive): Maximum Mana +5% (Warrior: Maximum Rage +5%). In Classic it was +5% Intellect." }, { "Engineering Specialization", "inv_misc_gear_01", "Changed (passive): -20% failure/backfire of Engineering devices (Classic: +skill)." } }, "Priest is a new combination: Confounding Flash (AoE CC) and Contingency Plan (life-saving cooldown). Arcane Resistance removed. For the Mage, Eureka! + Expansive Mind help with mana; the Dun Morogh route is the v7 one." }, ["nightelf"] = { "Night Elf", { { "Elune's Light", "spell_nature_moonglow", "New, instant, 3 min cooldown: +10% critical strike with all spells and attacks for 15 sec." }, { "Shadowmeld", "ability_ambush", "Base 10 sec cooldown: hides you until you move. In combat now reduces aggro, but the cooldown rises to 2 min. (icon from tooltip 20580)" }, { "Quickness", "ability_racial_shadowmeld", "Passive: Dodge +1% and movement speed +2%; Rogue and Druid are harder to see in stealth (as if 1 level higher). changed." }, { "Wisp Spirit", "spell_nature_wispsplode", "Passive: after death you become a wisp with +75% speed (client tooltip). Warcraft Tavern writes \"extra 25%\": discrepancy." } }, "No new class. Nature Resistance removed. Teldrassil is an island: the first useful Flight Master is Vesprystus in Rut'theran, who only flies to Auberdine. Soft Saber Sack (6 slots) from Aldia in Dolanaar at lvl 4." }, ["skyborne_a"] = { "Skyborne (High Order)", { { "Walk on Air", "inv_elemental_primal_air", "New, instant, 1.5 min cooldown: glide downward for 10 sec while steering." }, { "Read Leyline", "ability_mage_incantersabsorbtion", "New (High Order only): 0.5 sec cast, 2 min cooldown, +50% Health and Mana regeneration for 15 sec. Near a Ley Line you become Attuned for 1 hour and the effect rises by 100%. Does not stack with Innervate. + WT" }, { "Wind Blessed", "inv_misc_volatileair", "New (passive): Haste +2% (spell, melee, ranged)." }, { "Elemental Insight", "achievement_raidprimalist_windelemental", "New (passive): +5% damage vs Elementals." } }, "Requires a purchase bundle (Skyborne Heroic/Epic Pack). They start in Thendal Village and leave Zephras Isle at ~12-14. High Order reputation: 5% discount at Friendly up to 20% at Exalted on mounts and Riding (Galestrider, Fairweather Stables 53.8 81.3). Darnassian shared with Night Elves; only Skyborne with Mage (the Windshapers have Shaman). The race icon is the Blood Elf one (similar model): no Skyborne icon found." }, ["orc"] = { "Orc", { { "Blood Fury", "racial_orc_berserkerstrength", "Active (2 min cooldown): +10% Attack Power and Spell Power for 15 s. Now also Spell Power and no penalty to healing received; the 3 min cooldown from Oct 15 returned to 2 min on Oct 27. (patch notes Oct 15/26/27, Warcraft Tavern, Kami-Labs)" }, { "Shatter Curse", "spell_nature_removecurse", "Active new: instantly removes all Curses and Bane and reduces magic damage taken by 5% for 8 s (was immunity and 15% in beta). Cooldown not confirmed. (Wowhead Forever + Oct 15 notes; the “3 min” cooldown is only from LFCarry )" }, { "Hardiness", "inv_helmet_23", "Passive: stun duration on you is reduced by 20%. Previously it was a 25-35% chance to resist." }, { "Command", "ability_warrior_warcry", "Passive: +5% Pet damage for Hunter and Warlock. Removed in beta, restored Oct 26 (replacing Savage +1% crit). Axe Specialization was removed. (Warcraft Tavern Oct 26, Kami-Labs)" } }, "Mage Orc is a new combination: Blood Fury gives Spell Power. For Hunter and Warlock, Command only counts with the Pet out. Start in the Valley of Trials (The Den) and don't stray from Razor Hill before 10." }, ["troll"] = { "Troll", { { "Berserking", "racial_troll_berserk", "Active (3 min cooldown): +10% Attack Speed and Spell Haste for 15 s. Now fixed at 10%, no longer up to 30% at low health; duration raised to 15 s on Oct 27 (was 10)." }, { "Regeneration", "spell_nature_regenerate", "Passive: +20% Health regeneration, and the 20% continues in combat. Was 10% in beta, 20% from Oct 15." }, { "Rapid Regeneration", "ability_racial_regeneratin", "Active new: restores 50% of max Health over 6 s (channel: any movement, action or damage cancels it). Cooldown not found. (Wowhead Forever; Warcraft Tavern)" }, { "Beast Slaying", "inv_misc_pelt_bear_ruin_02", "Passive: +5% damage vs Beasts. Very useful in the Barrens (raptor, plainstrider, hyena)." } }, "Troll Warlock is new. Rapid Regeneration counts as free “food” between pulls. If you're a Hunter, Beast Slaying adds to the Pet and works on almost all Barrens creatures. Troll Priest: Hex of Weakness and Shadowguard." }, ["tauren"] = { "Tauren", { { "War Stomp", "ability_warstomp", "Active: 0.5 s cast, stuns up to 5 enemies within 8 yd for 2 s. 90 s cooldown (was 2 min); Druids can use it in form." }, { "Cultivation", "inv_misc_flower_01", "Active changed: duplicates a nearby herb (15 min cooldown, 3 s cast, each herb only once), without needing Herbalism to gather it." }, { "Plainsrunning", "achievement_zone_barrens_01", "Passive new: +2% speed every 5 s of running, up to +60% after 2 min 30 (was +1%/30% until Oct 26). You lose 1 stack standing still for 1 s and 6 if you get hit. Doesn't work while mounted (the +3% mounted was removed Oct 26). Doesn't stack with other speed buffs." }, { "Endurance", "spell_nature_unyeildingstamina", "Passive: +5% total Health. The crit-damage bonus from Oct 15 was removed." } }, "Plainsrunning makes the Barrens very smooth: look for long routes without stopping. It's the only Horde race without a new class . Thunder Bluff is nearby (Tal) and the 12-slot bag quest from Skywatcher Plateau at 23." }, ["undead"] = { "Undead", { { "Will of the Forsaken", "spell_shadow_raisedead", "Active (2 min cooldown): instantly removes Charm, Fear and Sleep. No longer grants immunity; can't be used under Scatter Shot." }, { "Cannibalize", "ability_racial_cannibalize", "Active (2 min cooldown): on a Humanoid or Undead corpse within 5 yd, regenerates 7% of Health and Mana every 2 s for 10 s. Now also Mana." }, { "Underwater Breathing", "spell_shadow_demonbreath", "Passive: underwater breath +300%." }, { "Touch of the Grave", "spell_shadow_fingerofdeath", "Passive new: your spells and attacks have a 20% (Paladin, Rogue, Warrior) or 30% (casters) chance to drain Health up to 5% of your max Health; internal cooldown 15 s (was 25 s until Oct 27). (Kami-Labs Oct 27 + Wowhead Forever)" } }, "Undead Paladin is the faction's new combination. You don't have to cross the world: Tirisfal -> Silverpine -> Hillsbrad covers 1–30 and includes Ruins of Lordaeron (15–20). Priest: Touch of Weakness and Dark Sacrifice (Warcraft Tavern, races page)." }, ["skyborne_h"] = { "Skyborne Windshaper", { { "Walk on Air", "inv_elemental_primal_air", "Active new (shared with High Order): free Slow Fall with direction control, 90 s cooldown (was 2 min). (Warcraft Tavern, Oct 15 notes)" }, { "Skysight", "ability_skyreach_lens_flare", "Active new (Windshaper only): +15% speed on foot and mounted for 15 s, 2 min cooldown, doesn't stack with other buffs. Used near an Elemental Convergence it gives Charged: +30% for 1 hour (persists through death, removed in raids). Castable while moving. (Blizzard Oct 26; the Wowhead tooltip is outdated: 10%/30 s)" }, { "Wind Blessed", "inv_misc_volatileair", "Passive : +2% Haste to spells, melee and ranged (was 3% until Oct 26)." }, { "Elemental Insight", "achievement_raidprimalist_windelemental", "Passive : +5% damage vs Elementals." } }, "Follow Constable Aonda's quest for Valanaar right away and don't forget the Simple Leather Satchel bag (The Problem With Prideclaws). Use the Blessing of Zephras tornadoes (+40% speed for 5 min, ends with any hostile action). After Valanaar take the right Skycutter (58.2 79.5) to Thunder Bluff." } },
 },
 es = {
  druid = { why = { ["Ferocity"] = "Maul, Swipe, Claw y Rake cuestan 5 de Rage/Energy en 5/5: en Bear Form, más Maul; en Cat Form, una rotación mucho más barata. Todas las fuentes coinciden: primer talento.", ["Feral Instinct"] = "Swipe +30% y sigilo como +3 niveles: con Swipe (16) es tu AoE desde Oso en 10–19 (Mobalytics oso + wowforever.be).", ["Feral Swiftness"] = "+30% de velocidad en Cat Form (también en interiores) y +4% de Dodge: «uno de los mejores talentos para subir de nivel» (Mobalytics, games.gg, Warcraft Tavern).", ["Feral Charge"] = "Desde Oso: raíz + interrupción 4 s; desde Cat: salto tras el objetivo (se abre con Shred, CD 30 s). La pieza de movilidad en 20.", ["Savage Fury"] = "+10% de daño a Claw, Rake, Shred, Maul y Swipe: daño puro en todo el kit (requisito para Lacerate).", ["Shredding Attacks"] = "Shred cuesta 18 menos de Energy en 3/3 (y Lacerate 3 de Rage): Shred se convierte en tu rotación desde detrás del enemigo.", ["Sharpened Claws"] = "+6% crit en Bear Form y Cat Form en 2/2: más crits = más Combo Points extra con Blood Frenzy (requisito).", ["Lacerate"] = "Bleed acumulable hasta 5 (10% del daño del arma por acumulación), mucho threat: útil como Oso en mazmorras; en solitario como Cat vale poco ( elección de wowforever.be).", ["Predatory Discipline"] = "Ferocious Bite ya no convierte la Energy extra, sino que inflige daño adicional según la Energy sobrante: un remate más sencillo.", ["Leader of the Pack"] = "+3% crit para ti y el grupo en Cat/Bear Form, ahora en todos los crits (hotfix del 30 oct). Es el talento de nivel 30 según todas las fuentes.", ["Natural Instinct"] = "+20% de daño crit de habilidades cuerpo a cuerpo en 2/2 (y curación desde Intellect).", ["Blood Frenzy"] = "100% de probabilidad de +5 de Rage en crits en Bear Form; en Cat, los crits de habilidades generadoras dan un Combo Point extra el 100% de las veces.", ["Furor"] = "Shifting te da 10 de Rage en Oso y devuelve tu Energy en Cat: cambias de forma sin perder ritmo (yumytv, 13–17).", ["Primal Bite"] = "Bite con 42/62/77 de daño extra y mucho threat (hotfix del 30 oct), movido a la fila 7: necesita 30 puntos en el árbol, así que llega en 40.", ["Shifting Power"] = "Convierte el 55% del maná base en 40 de Energy (CD 8 s tras el hotfix del 30 oct): el maná como segunda barra de Energy. Fila 7 = nivel 41 en el cliente.", ["Brutal Impact"] = "Bash y Pounce aturden +1 s, y Bash tiene 30 s de CD: control extra para pulls difíciles.", ["Heart of the Wild"] = "+10% de Intellect, +20% de Stamina en Bear, +10% de Strength en Cat en 5/5. Tras el hotfix está en el árbol de Restoration, así que llega después del 44.", ["Natural Shapeshifter"] = "30% de coste de maná de todas las formas: menos tiempo bebiendo si cambias de forma a menudo.", ["Naturalist"] = "+10% a todo el daño que causas (y Healing Touch/Wild Growth más rápidos): daño extra gratis en Restoration.", ["Reflection"] = "Hasta el 50% de la regeneración continua de maná mientras lanzas: ayuda a curar y a cambiar de forma.", ["Swiftmend"] = "Curación instantánea que consume tu Rejuvenation/Regrowth: la piedra angular de 60 para autocuración en solitario.", ["Predatory Strikes"] = "Attack Power en forma Cat y Oso igual a 150% de tu nivel (3/3): más daño sin equipo." },
   summary = "Feral (Cat desde 20, Oso cuando haga falta) es la especialización para subir de nivel en solitario más recomendada: Warcraft Tavern (Luxrah) 'Feral cats will have the smoothest route', Method (BirraGzeez) 'the fastest and most popular choice', mmonster (lista del 5 nov) y Mobalytics. Desde el 6 nov la build A es la de Mobalytics {yumytv} (299 , guía de Druid 1–60 actualizada tras el lanzamiento): Ferocity, Furor 5 (Energy y Rage al cambiar de forma), Feral Swiftness, Sharpened Claws y Savage Fury, Feral Charge en 24, Leader of the Pack en 30, Shifting Power en 40; luego Balance (Genesis, Nature's Majesty) y Restoration (Heart of the Wild, Naturalist), 9/31/11 en 60. wowforever.be (datos del cliente) va 0/34/17.", bsum = { b = "Te gusta jugar de lanzador con raíz y kiting a distancia; no es para subir de nivel lo más rápido." }, rot = { { "1–9 · Lanzador (sin forma)", { { "spell_nature_thorns", "Espinas (desde 6)" }, { "spell_nature_abolishmagic", "Wrath (pull)" }, { "spell_nature_starfall", "Moonfire" }, { "spell_nature_abolishmagic", "Wrath" }, { "ability_meleedamage", "Auto-attack" } }, "Espinas sobre ti mismo. Wrath para empezar, Moonfire para el DoT, Wrath mientras tengas maná, y luego remata cuerpo a cuerpo. Rejuvenation sobre ti cuando haga falta. Con Moonfire puedes mantener el DoT en 2 enemigos (games.gg). Sin maná = auto-ataque. Fuentes: Warcraft Tavern, games.gg, Method." }, { "10–19 · Bear Form", { { "spell_nature_resistnature", "Curación antes del pull" }, { "ability_racial_bearform", "Bear Form" }, { "ability_druid_enrage", "Enrage" }, { "ability_druid_demoralizingroar", "Demoralizing Roar" }, { "ability_druid_maul", "Maul / Swipe" } }, "Antes del pull, cúrate (Rejuvenation, Regrowth, Healing Touch); luego Wrath x2 + Moonfire a distancia y Bear Form cuando llegue el enemigo (Method). Enrage para Rage instantáneo, Demoralizing Roar solo en enemigos físicos, Maul en objetivo único, Swipe (16) en 2 o más enemigos. Feral Charge solo llega en 20 en la build del cliente (games.gg lo tenía antes: desactualizado). No hagas pull de más de 2 enemigos." }, { "20–29 · Cat Form", { { "ability_ambush", "Prowl" }, { "ability_druid_disembowel", "Rake" }, { "spell_shadow_vampiricaura", "Shred (desde detrás)" }, { "ability_druid_rake", "Claw" }, { "ability_druid_ferociousbite", "Ferocious Bite (24, 5 CP)" } }, "Rejuvenation antes de atraer, espera unos segundos en Cat Form para llenar Energy. Prowl, luego Feral Charge detrás del monstruo o Shred por detrás; Faerie Fire para atraer desde distancia; Rake si el monstruo vive más de ~6 s; Shred (Claw si no estás detrás) para puntos de combo; desde 24 Ferocious Bite con 5 puntos de combo y Energy llena (Mobalytics); Rip solo si el monstruo sigue vivo 10 s. Desde 24 Tiger's Fury . Dash para moverte. No hacen falta finalizadores contra monstruos que mueren en 3 golpes. Fuentes: Tavern, Method, games.gg." }, { "30–39 · Cat avanzado", { { "ability_ambush", "Prowl" }, { "ability_druid_ravage", "Ravage / Pounce" }, { "spell_nature_faeriefire", "Faerie Fire" }, { "ability_druid_disembowel", "Rake" }, { "ability_druid_ferociousbite", "Ferocious Bite (5 CP)" } }, "Ravage (32) o Pounce (36) desde Prowl, Faerie Fire, Rake, Shred/Claw hasta 5 puntos de combo, Ferocious Bite (con Predatory Discipline)." }, { "40–60 · Rotación completa", { { "ability_ambush", "Prowl" }, { "ability_druid_ravage", "Ravage" }, { "spell_nature_faeriefire", "Faerie Fire" }, { "ability_druid_disembowel", "Rake" }, { "spell_druid_displacement", "Shifting Power" }, { "ability_druid_rake", "Claw" }, { "ability_druid_ferociousbite", "Ferocious Bite (5 CP)" } }, "Prowl detrás del monstruo, Ravage, Faerie Fire, Rake, Shifting Power (40: convierte el maná en 40 de Energy), Claw hasta 5 puntos de combo; con 5 puntos espera Energy llena y usa Ferocious Bite, antes si termina el monstruo. Shifting Power una vez por monstruo, así tu maná se regenera al final del combate. Thorns y Mark of the Wild siempre activos (Mobalytics – yumytv, 14 nov). Desde 40 forma Dire Oso para mazmorras y varios monstruos (Method)." }, { "AoE / pulls múltiples", { { "ability_racial_bearform", "Bear Form" }, { "ability_druid_enrage", "Enrage" }, { "ability_druid_demoralizingroar", "Demoralizing Roar" }, { "inv_misc_monsterclaw_03", "Swipe" } }, "Más de 2 enemigos: Bear Form, Enrage, Roar (solo físicos), Swipe (Feral Instinct +30%). Entangling Roots mantiene a uno extra alejado; Nature's Grasp para escapar; Bash para detener a un enemigo. No hay AoE desde Cat: con 3 o más enemigos, cambia a Oso." } },
   brot = { b = { { "Objetivo único · Eclipse", { { "spell_nature_abolishmagic", "Wrath" }, { "spell_arcane_starfire", "Starfire" }, { "spell_nature_starfall", "Moonfire" }, { "spell_nature_insectswarm", "Insect Swarm" } }, "Build de Eclipse (Tavern): Starfire y Wrath a objetivo único. Moonfire e Insect Swarm mantienen el DoT; Insect Swarm desde 25." }, { "Enemigos entrantes · Raíz y kiting", { { "spell_nature_stranglevines", "Entangling Roots" }, { "spell_nature_starfall", "Moonfire" } }, "Raíz a distancia y kiting. Tavern: el kiting es una fortaleza del Druida; enraizar desde lejos hace que el enemigo pierda tiempo sin dañarte." } } },
   notes = { { "Recursos y tiempos muertos", "• {Maná} sigue regenerándose en forma, pero está oculto: activa ‘Personal Resource Display’ en Opciones, Combate (Tavern). El maná es necesario para volver a la forma (cambiar de forma cuesta maná; Natural Shapeshifter 30%) y para Shifting Power.\n• Energy y Rage se regeneran continuamente; en Oso, la Energy no se regenera, y el Powershifting o el Bear Weaving ya no compensan (Tavern). Furor devuelve el recurso al cambiar de forma.\n• Pociones, vendas y comida se pueden usar sin salir de la forma (1–8 oct); la mayoría de objetos y PNJ son usables en forma, pero las curaciones y utilidades (Rebirth, Innervate, Cure Poison) requieren salir.\n• Cúrate entre pulls: Rejuvenation (Swiftmend solo en 60). Lleva agua adecuada a tu nivel (una nueva cada ~10 niveles).\n• Cambiar de forma quita la raíz y la lentitud: cambia en vez de esperar.\n• Idol of Shifting Tides (misión de Aquatic Form): menos maná para cambios de forma." }, { "Posición y Combo Points", "Shred requiere estar detrás del enemigo; desde detrás no te pueden parar ni golpear ataques frontales. Feral Charge desde Cat te pone detrás automáticamente. Combo Points: Tavern dice que no se conservan entre objetivos; games.gg (17 sep) dice que sí: verifícalo en el juego. Los sangrados ignoran la armadura: muy buenos contra enemigos blindados." } }, stats = "Prioridad Feral: Strength / Agility / Attack Power > Stamina / Intellect / Spirit > Armor (Tavern, Mid-level Feral); games.gg: Strength > Agility = Stamina > Intellect > Spirit; wow.gg: Weapon Damage > Hit/Expertise > crit. Antes de 10 (y para Balance): Intellect/Spell Damage. En Forever, los ataques en Cat/Bear escalan con el DPS del arma (velocidad 1.0 o 2.5 s según la forma): el arma con más DPS es la mejor mejora. Polearms desde 20; también Daggers, Fist Weapons, One/Two-Handed Maces y Staves (entrenador de armas en Forjaz, Cima del Trueno, Orgrimmar, Entrañas y Stormwind). Objetos citados: Yelmo cabeza de lobo (Leatherworking), Manual de Muchedumbre de Puñetazos (Gnomeregan 29–38), Embrace of the Viper (set, Cuevas de los Lamentos 17–24, también cambia Cat Form), Idol of Shifting Tides (misión de Aquatic Form). Niveles de fabricación y requisitos no leídos .", forever = { "30 oct (build 70707; noticias de wowforever.be del 31 oct, GitHub #455, Tactyks con 15,8 mil visualizaciones el 31 oct): árbol de Druida reorganizado: Berserk eliminado, Furor y Heart of the Wild intercambiaron de árbol, Primal Bite 42/62/77 movido a la fila 7, Shifting Power con CD 8 s, Leader of the Pack en todos los crits, nuevos Lacerate, Predatory Discipline y Bloom.", "Pociones y consumibles (incluidos Té de cardo y pociones de maná) usables en Oso/Cat sin salir de la forma; los encantamientos y procs del arma funcionan en forma; inmunes a Disarm (1–8 oct, wofwforever 15 oct).", "El auto-ataque en forma usa el DPS del arma (1.0 s Cat / 2.5 s Oso); nuevos Polearms en 20.", "Powershifting y Bear Weaving ya no compensan; Furor restaura el 100% de Energy al cambiar de forma (Tavern, 15 oct).", "Nature's Grasp (10), Revive (12), Omen of Clarity (20, pasivo), Faerie Fire y Shred (20, 15 oct) base; Dual Talent Specialization en 40.", "Claw ~110% del daño del arma (como Mangle), Shred 155% (antes 225%), Tiger's Fury +15% de daño durante 6 s , Enrage 30 de Rage en total, Frenzied Regeneration basado en porcentaje, todos los DoT pueden hacer crit (KamiLabs, 26 sep; no verificado de nuevo en el cliente).", "Cat Form ya no reduce el HP máximo (8 oct), +50% de threat desde Oso (8 oct), Faerie Fire no cuesta nada y tiene CD de 6 s en forma con threat (15 oct).", "Talentoso (Legacy): puntos de talento desde nivel 5 en vez de 10 (hechizo del cliente 1225474; Tavern: hasta 5 niveles antes).", "Nueva raza Skyborne (Isla de Zephras 3–12, entrenador de Druida local) con misiones de forma propias.", "En el lanzamiento (notas de Blizzard del 3 nov): Claw 140% de daño de arma, Shred 200%, Ravage 435%; Rip, Rake, Pounce y Ferocious Bite alrededor de +25%; Starfire alrededor de +40%; forma Dire Oso +115% de amenaza; Rend and Tear hasta 15%." },
   races = { ["nightelf"] = "Alianza. Elune's Light (+10% crit durante 15 s, ráfaga), Shadowmeld, Quickness (+1% Dodge, +2% velocidad), Wisp Spirit. games.gg: «lo mejor para parses, cerca del Tauren»; Method: la opción polivalente de la Alianza. Misiones de Druida en Darnassus.", ["tauren"] = "Horda. War Stomp (aturdimiento de 2 s a 5 enemigos, CD 90 s, usable en forma ), Cultivation (duplica una hierba, CD 15 min), Plainsrunning (+1% de velocidad cada 5 s hasta +30%, +3% montado), Endurance (+5% HP y +1% Hit). games.gg: «la más fuerte» para Druidas; Method: ideal para tanque Oso y PvP. Misiones en Cima del Trueno.", ["skyborne_a"] = "High Order (Alianza). Walk on Air (caída lenta, CD 90 s), Wind Blessed (+1–2% de celeridad cifras contradictorias), Elemental Insight (+5% de daño contra Elemental), Read Ley Line (+50%/100% de HP y regeneración de maná durante 15 s, CD 2 min; no se acumula con Innervate: reduce los tiempos muertos entre pulls). Empiezas en Isla de Zephras (3–12).", ["skyborne_h"] = "Windshaper (Horda). Walk on Air, Wind Blessed, Elemental Insight, Skysight (+10–15% de velocidad, 15 s, CD 2 min cifras contradictorias). Method: Windshaper es genial para Feral Cat y Balance gracias a la celeridad. Isla de Zephras y luego el entrenador de Dalaran (Alfina Miradanocturna) para la Horda." },
   spells = { { 1, "Mark of the Wild", "spell_nature_regeneration", "Buff de estadísticas y resistencia para ti y el grupo; mantenlo siempre (funciona también en mascotas).", false }, { 1, "Wrath", "spell_nature_abolishmagic", "Daño de Nature con lanzamiento; tu ataque de pull hasta el nivel 10.", false }, { 1, "Healing Touch", "spell_nature_healingtouch", "Curación con lanzamiento: cúrate entre pulls.", false }, { 4, "Moonfire", "spell_nature_starfall", "Daño Arcane + DoT, puede hacer crit (el DoT también). Mantenlo en 2 enemigos.", false }, { 4, "Rejuvenation", "spell_nature_rejuvenation", "HoT: cúrate antes de cada pull.", false }, { 6, "Thorns", "spell_nature_thorns", "Daña a quien te golpee; escala con spell power. Mantenlo sobre ti en todo momento.", false }, { 8, "Entangling Roots", "spell_nature_stranglevines", "Raíz a distancia para mantener un enemigo extra alejado.", false }, { 10, "Bear Form", "ability_racial_bearform", "Misión de clase (ver pasos). Mucha armadura y HP, Rage como recurso; algo menos de HP que en Classic.", false }, { 10, "Growl", "ability_physical_taunt", "Provocación de un solo objetivo (de la misión de Bear Form).", false }, { 10, "Maul", "ability_druid_maul", "Tu gasto de Rage de un solo objetivo (de la misión).", false }, { 10, "Demoralizing Roar", "ability_druid_demoralizingroar", "Debuff que reduce el daño físico de los enemigos; no lo uses contra lanzadores.", false }, { 10, "Nature's Grasp", "spell_nature_natureswrath", "Ahora base en 10: enraíza a quien te golpee cuerpo a cuerpo, así puedes escapar.", false }, { 10, "Teleport: Moonglade", "spell_arcane_teleportmoonglade", "Misión de clase: teletransporte a Claro de la Luna (entrenador Loganaar en Nighthaven).", false }, { 12, "Regrowth", "spell_nature_resistnature", "Curación + HoT, más rápida que Healing Touch.", false }, { 12, "Revive", "spell_nature_reincarnation", "Ahora base en 12: resucita a un jugador fuera de combate.", false }, { 12, "Enrage", "ability_druid_enrage", "10 de Rage al instante + 20 en 10 s (total 30), CD de 1 min; desde Oso.", false }, { 14, "Cure Poison", "spell_nature_nullifypoison", "Misión de clase «Nuevas lecciones»: elimina un veneno.", false }, { 14, "Bash", "ability_druid_bash", "Aturdimiento desde Oso; con Brutal Impact aturde más tiempo y con un CD más corto.", false }, { 16, "Aquatic Form", "ability_druid_aquaticform", "Misión de clase «Una lección que aprender»: natación rápida y aliento infinito. Recompensa: Idol of Shifting Tides.", false }, { 16, "Swipe", "inv_misc_monsterclaw_03", "Tu AoE desde Oso; Feral Instinct +30%.", false }, { 18, "Faerie Fire", "spell_nature_faeriefire", "Base (sin talento): debuff de armadura, pull a distancia; cuesta 0 en forma, CD de 6 s y genera threat (15 oct).", false }, { 18, "Hibernate", "spell_nature_sleep", "CC sobre Beast y Dragonkin (datos Classic).", false }, { 20, "Cat Form", "ability_druid_catform", "Misión de clase «Gran espíritu felino»: DPS cuerpo a cuerpo con Energy y Combo Points. Ya no reduce el HP máximo.", false }, { 20, "Claw", "ability_druid_rake", "Generador de Combo Points (de la misión); ahora ~110% del daño del arma, como Mangle (KamiLabs, 26 sep).", false }, { 20, "Prowl", "ability_ambush", "Sigilo en Cat Form: tú eliges cuándo empezar el combate.", false }, { 20, "Rip", "ability_ghoulfrenzy", "Remate de sangrado (de la misión); úsalo solo si el enemigo vive lo suficiente.", false }, { 20, "Shred", "spell_shadow_vampiricaura", "Rango 1 en 20 (antes 22, 15 oct): generador desde detrás, ~155% del daño del arma.", false }, { 20, "Starfire", "spell_arcane_starfire", "Daño Arcane con lanzamiento largo (para Balance, raramente para Feral).", false }, { 20, "Rebirth", "spell_nature_reincarnation", "Resurrección en combate: consume un reagente (depende del rango).", false }, { 20, "Omen of Clarity", "spell_nature_crystalball", "Ahora un pasivo base: procs gratis de hechizos y habilidades, incluidos los ticks de DoT/HoT.", false }, { 20, "Polearms", "ability_meleedamage", "Nueva arma para Druidas: Woo Ping (Stormwind) / Archibald (Entrañas).", false }, { 22, "Soothe Animal", "ability_hunter_beastsoothe", "Calma a un animal (datos Classic).", false }, { 24, "Remove Curse", "spell_nature_removecurse", "Elimina una maldición.", false }, { 24, "Rake", "ability_druid_disembowel", "Generador + sangrado: úsalo si el enemigo vive más de ~6 s.", false }, { 24, "Tiger's Fury", "ability_mount_jungletiger", "(KamiLabs 26 sep, no en Tavern/Method): +15% a todo el daño durante 6 s, incluidos los DoT; nivel por verificar.", false }, { 24, "Ferocious Bite", "ability_druid_ferociousbite", "Remate desde Cat; con Predatory Discipline inflige daño extra según la Energy sobrante.", false }, { 24, "Feral Charge", "ability_hunter_pet_bear", "Oso: carga + raíz + interrupción 4 s; Cat: salta tras el objetivo (CD 30 s).", true }, { 26, "Dash", "ability_druid_dash", "Sprint en Cat Form.", false }, { 26, "Abolish Poison", "spell_nature_nullifypoison_02", "Elimina el veneno con el tiempo.", false }, { 28, "Cower", "ability_druid_cower", "Menos threat desde Cat (útil en grupos).", false }, { 28, "Challenging Roar", "ability_druid_challangingroar", "Provocación en área desde Oso, CD de 10 min.", false }, { 30, "Travel Form", "ability_druid_travelform", "+40% de velocidad de carrera al aire libre sin montura: sustituye a una montura hasta el nivel 40.", false }, { 30, "Tranquility", "spell_nature_tranquility", "Curación en grupo mediante canalización.", false }, { 30, "Leader of the Pack", "spell_nature_unyeildingstamina", "+3% crit para ti y el grupo en Cat/Bear Form (aura).", true }, { 32, "Ravage", "ability_druid_ravage", "Apertura sigilosa desde detrás (Cat).", false }, { 32, "Track Humanoids", "ability_tracking", "Rastreo de humanoides en Cat Form.", false }, { 36, "Pounce", "ability_druid_supriseattack", "Apertura desde Prowl con aturdimiento.", false }, { 36, "Frenzied Regeneration", "ability_bullrush", "Convierte Rage en HP como porcentaje (10 de Rage = 10% HP).", false }, { 40, "Dire Bear Form", "ability_racial_bearform", "Bear Form mejorada (entrenador).", false }, { 40, "Innervate", "spell_nature_lightning", "Potente regeneración de maná; sal de la forma para lanzarla.", false }, { 40, "Hurricane", "spell_nature_cyclone", "Sin enfriamiento (Balance).", false }, { 40, "Feline Grace", "ability_druid_catform", "Pasivo de Cat (entrenador, datos de Tavern; efecto no leído ).", false }, { 40, "Dual Talent Specialization", "inv_misc_book_09", "Segunda especialización (p. ej., Feral + Restoration para mazmorras).", false }, { 40, "Shifting Power", "spell_druid_displacement", "55% del maná base en 40 de Energy, CD 8 s (desde Cat).", true }, { 44, "Barkskin", "spell_nature_stoneclawtotem", "Reducción de daño en todas las formas.", false } },
   bsp = { b = { { 1, "Mark of the Wild", "spell_nature_regeneration", "Buff de estadísticas y resistencia para ti y el grupo; mantenlo siempre (funciona también en mascotas).", false }, { 1, "Wrath", "spell_nature_abolishmagic", "Daño de Nature con lanzamiento; tu ataque de pull hasta el nivel 10.", false }, { 1, "Healing Touch", "spell_nature_healingtouch", "Curación con lanzamiento: cúrate entre pulls.", false }, { 4, "Moonfire", "spell_nature_starfall", "Daño Arcane + DoT, puede hacer crit (el DoT también). Mantenlo en 2 enemigos.", false }, { 4, "Rejuvenation", "spell_nature_rejuvenation", "HoT: cúrate antes de cada pull.", false }, { 6, "Thorns", "spell_nature_thorns", "Daña a quien te golpee; escala con spell power. Mantenlo sobre ti en todo momento.", false }, { 8, "Entangling Roots", "spell_nature_stranglevines", "Raíz a distancia para mantener un enemigo extra alejado.", false }, { 10, "Bear Form", "ability_racial_bearform", "Misión de clase (ver pasos). Mucha armadura y HP, Rage como recurso; algo menos de HP que en Classic.", false }, { 10, "Growl", "ability_physical_taunt", "Provocación de un solo objetivo (de la misión de Bear Form).", false }, { 10, "Maul", "ability_druid_maul", "Tu gasto de Rage de un solo objetivo (de la misión).", false }, { 10, "Demoralizing Roar", "ability_druid_demoralizingroar", "Debuff que reduce el daño físico de los enemigos; no lo uses contra lanzadores.", false }, { 10, "Nature's Grasp", "spell_nature_natureswrath", "Ahora base en 10: enraíza a quien te golpee cuerpo a cuerpo, así puedes escapar.", false }, { 10, "Teleport: Moonglade", "spell_arcane_teleportmoonglade", "Misión de clase: teletransporte a Claro de la Luna (entrenador Loganaar en Nighthaven).", false }, { 12, "Regrowth", "spell_nature_resistnature", "Curación + HoT, más rápida que Healing Touch.", false }, { 12, "Revive", "spell_nature_reincarnation", "Ahora base en 12: resucita a un jugador fuera de combate.", false }, { 12, "Enrage", "ability_druid_enrage", "10 de Rage al instante + 20 en 10 s (total 30), CD de 1 min; desde Oso.", false }, { 14, "Cure Poison", "spell_nature_nullifypoison", "Misión de clase «Nuevas lecciones»: elimina un veneno.", false }, { 14, "Bash", "ability_druid_bash", "Aturdimiento desde Oso; con Brutal Impact aturde más tiempo y con un CD más corto.", false }, { 16, "Aquatic Form", "ability_druid_aquaticform", "Misión de clase «Una lección que aprender»: natación rápida y aliento infinito. Recompensa: Idol of Shifting Tides.", false }, { 16, "Swipe", "inv_misc_monsterclaw_03", "Tu AoE desde Oso; Feral Instinct +30%.", false }, { 18, "Faerie Fire", "spell_nature_faeriefire", "Base (sin talento): debuff de armadura, pull a distancia; cuesta 0 en forma, CD de 6 s y genera threat (15 oct).", false }, { 18, "Hibernate", "spell_nature_sleep", "CC sobre Beast y Dragonkin (datos Classic).", false }, { 20, "Cat Form", "ability_druid_catform", "Misión de clase «Gran espíritu felino»: DPS cuerpo a cuerpo con Energy y Combo Points. Ya no reduce el HP máximo.", false }, { 20, "Claw", "ability_druid_rake", "Generador de Combo Points (de la misión); ahora ~110% del daño del arma, como Mangle (KamiLabs, 26 sep).", false }, { 20, "Prowl", "ability_ambush", "Sigilo en Cat Form: tú eliges cuándo empezar el combate.", false }, { 20, "Rip", "ability_ghoulfrenzy", "Remate de sangrado (de la misión); úsalo solo si el enemigo vive lo suficiente.", false }, { 20, "Shred", "spell_shadow_vampiricaura", "Rango 1 en 20 (antes 22, 15 oct): generador desde detrás, ~155% del daño del arma.", false }, { 20, "Starfire", "spell_arcane_starfire", "Daño Arcane con lanzamiento largo (para Balance, raramente para Feral).", false }, { 20, "Rebirth", "spell_nature_reincarnation", "Resurrección en combate: consume un reagente (depende del rango).", false }, { 20, "Omen of Clarity", "spell_nature_crystalball", "Ahora un pasivo base: procs gratis de hechizos y habilidades, incluidos los ticks de DoT/HoT.", false }, { 20, "Polearms", "ability_meleedamage", "Nueva arma para Druidas: Woo Ping (Stormwind) / Archibald (Entrañas).", false }, { 22, "Soothe Animal", "ability_hunter_beastsoothe", "Calma a un animal (datos Classic).", false }, { 24, "Remove Curse", "spell_nature_removecurse", "Elimina una maldición.", false }, { 24, "Rake", "ability_druid_disembowel", "Generador + sangrado: úsalo si el enemigo vive más de ~6 s.", false }, { 24, "Tiger's Fury", "ability_mount_jungletiger", "(KamiLabs 26 sep, no en Tavern/Method): +15% a todo el daño durante 6 s, incluidos los DoT; nivel por verificar.", false }, { 24, "Ferocious Bite", "ability_druid_ferociousbite", "Remate desde Cat; con Predatory Discipline inflige daño extra según la Energy sobrante.", false }, { 25, "Insect Swarm (talento)", "spell_nature_insectswarm", "", true }, { 26, "Dash", "ability_druid_dash", "Sprint en Cat Form.", false }, { 26, "Abolish Poison", "spell_nature_nullifypoison_02", "Elimina el veneno con el tiempo.", false }, { 28, "Cower", "ability_druid_cower", "Menos threat desde Cat (útil en grupos).", false }, { 28, "Challenging Roar", "ability_druid_challangingroar", "Provocación en área desde Oso, CD de 10 min.", false }, { 30, "Travel Form", "ability_druid_travelform", "+40% de velocidad de carrera al aire libre sin montura: sustituye a una montura hasta el nivel 40.", false }, { 30, "Tranquility", "spell_nature_tranquility", "Curación en grupo mediante canalización.", false }, { 32, "Ravage", "ability_druid_ravage", "Apertura sigilosa desde detrás (Cat).", false }, { 32, "Track Humanoids", "ability_tracking", "Rastreo de humanoides en Cat Form.", false }, { 36, "Pounce", "ability_druid_supriseattack", "Apertura desde Prowl con aturdimiento.", false }, { 36, "Frenzied Regeneration", "ability_bullrush", "Convierte Rage en HP como porcentaje (10 de Rage = 10% HP).", false }, { 40, "Dire Bear Form", "ability_racial_bearform", "Bear Form mejorada (entrenador).", false }, { 40, "Innervate", "spell_nature_lightning", "Potente regeneración de maná; sal de la forma para lanzarla.", false }, { 40, "Hurricane", "spell_nature_cyclone", "Sin enfriamiento (Balance).", false }, { 40, "Feline Grace", "ability_druid_catform", "Pasivo de Cat (entrenador, datos de Tavern; efecto no leído ).", false }, { 40, "Dual Talent Specialization", "inv_misc_book_09", "Segunda especialización (p. ej., Feral + Restoration para mazmorras).", false }, { 40, "Moonkin Form (talento)", "spell_nature_forceofnature", "", true }, { 44, "Barkskin", "spell_nature_stoneclawtotem", "Reducción de daño en todas las formas.", false } } } },
  hunter = { why = { ["Deadly Aspects"] = "Con Aspect of the Hawk activo, Auto Shot tiene 2% por rango (10% en rango 5) de dar +30% de velocidad de ataque a distancia durante 12 s: es tu daño base. Todas las buenas fuentes la cogen primero.", ["Focused Fire"] = "+1% por rango (2% máx.) a todo el daño tuyo y de tu mascota mientras la mascota esté activa.", ["Improved Revive Pet"] = "Revive Pet 3/6 s más rápido y 20/40% de maná: tras morir tu mascota, pierdes menos tiempo. El segundo punto es donde las fuentes divergen (Method: sí, por supervivencia).", ["Endurance Training"] = "+3% por rango (15% máx.) a la salud y armadura de la mascota. También sirve de relleno legal: Unleashed Fury (fila 3) requiere 10 puntos ya gastados en el árbol (wowforever.be y Method lo hacen así).", ["Unleashed Fury"] = "+3% por rango (15% máx.) al daño de la mascota y del Halcón: el talento que más sube el daño total de subida de nivel.", ["Summon Hawk"] = "Nivel 25: bombardeo en picado (32 + 5% RAP) y Halcón durante 18 s, máx. 2 halcones; CD de 6 s compartido con Arcane Shot. Pasa a ser tu ataque principal (Method, Zockify).", ["Ferocity"] = "+2% por rango (10% máx.) de crit de la mascota y del Halcón; requerido por Frenzy.", ["Bestial Swiftness"] = "+30% de velocidad para la mascota: llega antes al enemigo. Requisito para Intimidation.", ["Intimidation"] = "Aturdimiento de 3 s en el siguiente golpe de la mascota (+100% crit en ese golpe) y mucho threat: útil para recuperar el aggro de un enemigo que viene hacia ti.", ["Improved Mend Pet"] = "Mend Pet tiene un 15/50% de probabilidad de disipar un debuff (maldición, enfermedad, magia, veneno) y cuesta menos maná (parche del 15 oct).", ["Frenzy"] = "Tras un crit, la mascota tiene un 20% por rango (100% en rango 5) de probabilidad de +30% de velocidad de ataque durante 8 s. Requiere Ferocity.", ["Bestial Wrath"] = "Nivel 40: la mascota +50% de daño durante 18 s (enfriamiento de 2 min), inmune a CC. Remate del árbol (31.º punto).", ["Lethal Attacks"] = "+1% por rango (5% máx.) de crit con todos los ataques: primer paso del 31/20/0.", ["Careful Aim"] = "Convierte el 20% por rango (100% máx.) de tu Intellect en Attack Power. Mobalytics (Crix) lo omite en 1–30 porque el Intellect es bajo; en 46–50 tiene más sentido.", ["Hawk Eye"] = "+2 yd por rango (6 yd máx.) al alcance del arma a distancia: más tiempo para disparar antes del cuerpo a cuerpo.", ["Rapid Killing"] = "Rapid Fire 1/2 min de enfriamiento; tras una muerte, el siguiente disparo hace +10/20%.", ["Trueshot Aura"] = "Nivel 56 en esta build: +15 RAP a grupo y banda en 45 yd (a toda la banda desde el 15 oct); útil en grupos y mazmorras.", ["Mortal Shots"] = "+6% por rango (30% máx.) al daño crit de todas las habilidades a distancia.", ["Pathfinding"] = "Cheetah y Aspect of the Pack más rápidos (+6% en 2/2): menos carrera entre monstruos. Está en la fila 3: se toma tras 10 puntos en Beast Mastery (Feor en 20–21).", ["Bestial Discipline"] = "Tu mascota regenera Focus un 20% más rápido y el 50% de tu regeneración de maná continúa al lanzar (en 2/2): menos pausas para beber." },
   summary = "Beast Mastery es la especialización más cómoda para subir de nivel en solitario: Warcraft Tavern, Method (Celz, 21 oct), Zockify (25 oct) y la guía de Hunter más votada en Mobalytics (Feor, {775 }, Verified, act. 18 nov) la eligen, y Feor da el orden nivel a nivel de 10 a 60. La mascota retiene la amenaza mientras disparas a distancia: pocas muertes y poco tiempo muerto. La build sigue a Feor: Pathfinding en 20–21, Summon Hawk en 25, Intimidation en 30, Bestial Wrath en 40, luego 20 puntos en Marksmanship (31 BM + 20 MM). Mascotas recomendadas: Cat (daño) o Boar (resistencia), domadas según nivel y zona.", bsum = { b = "Quieres más daño quieto a distancia y aceptas hacer más kiting: no es para una subida de nivel más tranquila." }, rot = { { "1–9 · Kiting sin mascota", { { "ability_hunter_aspectofthemonkey", "Aspect of the Monkey" }, { "ability_hunter_snipershot", "Hunter's Mark" }, { "ability_whirlwind", "Auto Shot" }, { "ability_hunter_quickshot", "Serpent Sting" }, { "ability_impalingbolt", "Arcane Shot" }, { "spell_frost_stun", "Concussive Shot" }, { "ability_meleedamage", "Raptor Strike" } }, "Abre desde la máxima distancia: Auto Shot (quieto 0.5 s), Serpent Sting solo si el enemigo vive lo suficiente, Arcane Shot en cuanto esté disponible. Tras cada disparo, da un paso atrás y retoma; Concussive Shot desde 8 para ralentizar. Si llega al cuerpo a cuerpo: Raptor Strike. Un enemigo a la vez (Warcraft Tavern, Zockify)." }, { "10–19 · La mascota sujeta al enemigo", { { "ability_hunter_beastcall", "Call Pet" }, { "ability_physical_taunt", "Pet: Growl" }, { "spell_nature_ravenform", "Aspect of the Hawk" }, { "ability_hunter_snipershot", "Hunter's Mark" }, { "ability_whirlwind", "Auto Shot" }, { "ability_impalingbolt", "Arcane Shot" }, { "ability_hunter_mendpet", "Mend Pet" } }, "Manda la mascota primero y deja que use Growl; luego Hunter’s Mark, Auto Shot y Arcane Shot. Aspect of the Hawk siempre activo en combate. Desde 18, Multi-Shot con 2 o más enemigos. Mend Pet cuando baje. Si el enemigo te alcanza: Wing Clip (12) o Concussive Shot, y vuelve a distancia (Method)." }, { "20–24 · Aimed Shot y Freezing Trap", { { "ability_hunter_beastcall", "Mascota delante" }, { "ability_hunter_quickshot", "Serpent Sting" }, { "inv_spear_07", "Aimed Shot" }, { "ability_impalingbolt", "Arcane Shot" }, { "spell_frost_chainsofice", "Freezing Trap" } }, "Aimed Shot (lanzamiento de 2 s) en objetivo único; Multi-Shot si hay 2–3 enemigos. Aimed Shot y Multi-Shot comparten 6 s: uno por ciclo; Arcane Shot tiene su propio temporizador. Freezing Trap en el enemigo extra (10 s). Aspect of the Cheetah (20) para moverte, pero vuelve a Hawk antes del pull." }, { "25–39 · Summon Hawk, 2 halcones siempre activos", { { "ability_hunter_animalhandler", "Summon Hawk" }, { "ability_hunter_animalhandler", "Summon Hawk" }, { "inv_spear_07", "Aimed Shot" }, { "ability_impalingbolt", "Arcane Shot" }, { "ability_hunter_runningshot", "Rapid Fire" } }, "Desde 25, mantén 2 halcones y la mascota en cada enemigo que viva más de unos segundos (duran 18 s: no los vuelvas a lanzar hasta el último segundo). Summon Hawk comparte 6 s con Arcane Shot: usa Arcane Shot cada tercer lanzamiento o en un enemigo casi muerto (Method). Rapid Fire (26) en pulls difíciles, Intimidation (30) si el enemigo se gira hacia ti, Feign Death (30) para reiniciar." }, { "40+ · Bestial Wrath", { { "ability_hunter_snipershot", "Hunter's Mark" }, { "ability_hunter_quickshot", "Serpent Sting" }, { "ability_hunter_animalhandler", "Summon Hawk ×2" }, { "inv_spear_07", "Aimed Shot" }, { "ability_druid_ferociousbite", "Bestial Wrath (élite)" }, { "ability_whirlwind", "Auto Shot" } }, "Hunter's Mark antes de atraer y la mascota ataca primero; luego Serpent Sting, 2 halcones con Summon Hawk, Aimed Shot en enfriamiento y Auto Shot. Bestial Wrath (40, +50% de daño de mascota durante 18 s) y Rapid Fire en élites y monstruos grandes; Intimidation si el monstruo se vuelve hacia ti, Disengage si pierdes la amenaza. Con mucho maná y 2 halcones activos durante 6 s más: Arcane Shot (Icy Veins). Para subir más rápido mantén 2 monstruos: Auto Shot al lejano, la mascota y Raptor Strike o Wing Clip al cercano, Multi-Shot cuando estén juntos (Mobalytics – Feor, 14 nov)." }, { "AoE · pulls múltiples", { { "spell_frost_freezingbreath", "Frost Trap" }, { "spell_frost_chainsofice", "Freezing Trap" }, { "ability_upgrademoonglaive", "Multi-Shot" }, { "ability_devour", "Intimidation" }, { "ability_rogue_feigndeath", "Feign Death" } }, "Frost Trap (28) ralentiza al grupo un 60%; Freezing Trap a un enemigo. Multi-Shot a 3 objetivos (gasta mucho maná). Si la mascota pierde threat: Intimidation (30) o Distracting Shot; si el enemigo te alcanza, Wing Clip y retrocede. Las trampas se pueden colocar en combate (CD de 30 s; una de fuego y una de hielo juntas desde el 15 oct), pero siempre a tus pies: retrocede hacia la trampa." } },
   brot = { b = { { "10–24 · Hawk Eye, Lethal Attacks, Careful Aim", { { "ability_whirlwind", "Auto Shot" }, { "ability_impalingbolt", "Arcane Shot" }, { "ability_townwatch", "Hawk Eye" } }, "Auto Shot quieto (0.5 s) como base; Arcane Shot en cuanto esté disponible. Hunter's Mark y Serpent Sting siguen en el kit, pero las fuentes no detallan la rotación de MM." }, { "25–40 · Trueshot Aura y Aimed Shot", { { "spell_nature_ravenform", "Aspect of the Hawk" }, { "ability_trueshot", "Trueshot Aura" }, { "inv_spear_07", "Aimed Shot" } }, "Tavern: Aspect of the Hawk y Trueshot Aura siempre sobre ti. Aimed Shot es base desde 20 (wowforever.gg): úsalo en los enemigos que sigan vivos." } } },
   notes = { { "Gestión de la mascota y threat", "• La mascota hace la mayor parte del daño y sostiene el threat: mándala primero, {Growl} en autocast (desactívalo en mazmorras si hay tanque).\n• {Aspect of the Hawk} siempre en combate; {Cheetah} solo al viajar (si te golpean, quedas Dazed 4 s).\n• Happiness: Happy 125% de daño, Content 100%, Unhappy 75%. Usa Feed Pet fuera de combate con comida de su dieta (bug de beta: solo se reduce cuando la mascota muere).\n• La mascota recibe el 25% del XP de los enemigos (solo verdes o superiores) y se detiene en tu nivel.\n• Las habilidades a distancia no funcionan a menos de 8 yd del enemigo: mantén la mascota delante." }, { "Maná y tiempos muertos", "• El maná es tu recurso (las mascotas usan Focus). Aimed Shot, Multi-Shot y Summon Hawk cuestan mucho: no lo gastes todo, guarda una reserva para Feign Death y trampas (Warcraft Tavern).\n• Si baja, deja trabajar a la mascota y a Auto Shot, sin habilidades que cuesten maná hasta que se regenere; bebe entre pulls.\n• El maná en combate depende del Spirit: {Bestial Discipline} (BM), Rapid Recuperation (MM) y Resourcefulness (Survival) ayudan.\n• Legacy: {Thrill of Adventure} da algo de vida y maná por cada muerte no trivial (wowforeverguides)." }, { "Chain pull y Feign Death", "El Hunter brilla en el chain pull: pasas al siguiente enemigo mientras el anterior muere por DoT o trampas, pero cuidado con los enemigos vivos que vagan hacia otros grupos (Warcraft Tavern). {Feign Death} (30) reinicia un pull malo: pon la mascota en pasivo y llámala primero, luego quédate en el suelo hasta que los enemigos se alejen (Zockify). Antes de 30, usa Scare Beast, Freezing Trap o Distracting Shot." } }, stats = "Prioridad (Warcraft Tavern): Agility > Attack Power > Critical Strike > Intellect > Stamina/Spirit > Strength > Armor. Antes de 10: Agility, AP, Intellect, Stamina/Spirit, Armor. El Spirit importa para el maná en combate (Bestial Discipline). El arma a distancia es tu primera mejora; después, cuerpo a cuerpo por estadísticas. A distancia (Warcraft Tavern): Ballesta barbárica (13–16, Sima Ígnea), Calibrated Blunderbuss (13–16, misión Hall of Thanes, solo Alianza), Venomstrike (19–22, Cuevas de los Lamentos), Troceacorazones Naga (22–29, Cavernas de Brazanegra), Arco largo Malarraíz (23–29, Cavernas de Brazanegra), Quilboar Blaster (29–30, misión Horado Rajacieno), Master Hunter’s Bow (30, misión Caza mayor). Fabricados y de mazmorra: Capucha de cuero de Camorrista, Botas de cuero oscuro, Stalker’s Leather Belt, Cubrepecho ensangrentado, Peto de corredor. Malla desde 40, Dual Wield desde 20 ( cliente, wowforeverguides).", forever = { "Aimed Shot es base en nivel 20 (lanzamiento de 2 s, CD de 6 s compartido con Multi-Shot): análisis profundo de Blizzard del 30 sep, cliente.", "Summon Hawk, nuevo talento de BM (nivel 25 con todos los puntos en BM): máx. 2 halcones, CD de 6 s compartido con Arcane Shot; desde el 15 oct el halcón aparece en el objetivo y se queda allí.", "Talentos nuevos: Focused Fire, Careful Aim (20–100% de Int -> AP), Lone Wolf, Rapid Killing; cambiados Deadly Aspects, Ferocity y Unleashed Fury (ahora también se aplican a los halcones). Intimidation requiere Bestial Swiftness.", "Trampas usables en combate (CD 30 s), una de fuego y una de hielo juntas, y trampa de fuego que escala con AP (15 oct).", "Mascotas: ganan estadísticas del equipo del Hunter (10% AP, 100% crit), cada familia tiene una habilidad única, Bite o Claw y Dash o Dive, el zorro es nuevo; heredan el crit más alto y se benefician de Expertise (15 oct).", "24 sep: Tame Beast no funciona en bestias por encima de tu nivel; Furious Howl 40%. 15 oct: Dismember 25%/6 s, Sonic Blast +30% de tiempo de lanzamiento/1 min de CD, Mine! 3 s/90 s; Improved Mend Pet reduce el coste de maná.", "15 oct: Auto Shot requiere 0.5 s quieto; nueva opción de Auto Attack/Auto Shot. Scorpid Sting ahora 2% hit; Aspect of the Beast da AP cuerpo a cuerpo; Disengage reduce el threat el doble.", "Humanos y Skyborne (Alianza y Horda) pueden ser Hunters. 26–27 oct: Orc Command +5% de daño a mascotas, Human Ruthless 1%, Skyborne Wind Blessed 2%.", "Mazmorras: XP de misiones reducido un 50% desde el 1 oct; Excavación: Los Humedales es nuevo.", "En el lanzamiento (notas de Blizzard y hotfix del 3 nov): Arcane Shot y Serpent Sting obtienen más Attack Power y hacen más daño, Aspect of the Hawk vuelve a valores de Classic, Trueshot Aura da hasta 100 de Attack Power a distancia, Barrage y Lightning Reflexes como en Classic; todas las trampas comparten un enfriamiento de 30 s." },
   races = { ["human"] = "Combinación nueva. Ruthless +1% crit (antes 2%, reducido a la mitad el 26 oct), The Human Spirit +10% de Spirit (duplicado), Will to Survive (elimina aturdimientos), Perception. Method lo recomienda, pero sus cifras son anteriores al parche.", ["dwarf"] = "Big Game Hunter: +5% de daño a Bestias (muchos enemigos de subida de nivel) ; Artisan’s Precision +1% Hit; Stoneform. Genial, pero sin racial para la mascota.", ["nightelf"] = "Shadowmeld (sigilo estando quieto, útil para beber), Elune’s Light (+10% crit durante 15 s, Method), Quickness (+1% Dodge, +2% velocidad), Wisp Spirit. Method: de las mejores razas de la Alianza.", ["skyborne_a"] = "High Order (Alianza): Wind Blessed +2% de celeridad (antes 3%, hasta el 26 oct), Walk on Air, Elemental Insight +5% contra Elementales, Read Ley Line (regenera HP y maná +50% durante 15 s, 100% si estás Attuned to a Ley Line). Empiezan en Isla de Zephras (3–12) con la nueva misión de Hunter y el zorro Vuldren alfa.", ["orc"] = "Command: las mascotas hacen +5% de daño (vuelto el 26 oct, para BM); Blood Fury +10% de AP durante 15 s con CD de 2 min; Hardiness (aturdimiento 20%); Shatter Curse. Según Method, la mejor raza de la Horda, pero Savage ha sido eliminado.", ["tauren"] = "War Stomp (aturdimiento de 2 s para escapar), Endurance (5% HP), Plainsrunning (+2% de velocidad cada 5 s, máx. 60%), Cultivation (duplica hierbas). Sin bonus ofensivo.", ["troll"] = "Beast Slaying +5% de daño a Bestias (genial para subir de nivel) ; Berserking +10% de celeridad durante 10 s; Regeneration; Rapid Regeneration (canalización, 50% HP). Con el Orco, es la opción más sensata para un Hunter de la Horda.", ["skyborne_h"] = "Windshaper (Horda): mismos Wind Blessed, Walk on Air y Elemental Insight; en vez de Read Ley Line tienen Skysight (+15% de velocidad durante 15 s, 30% con Charged a una convergencia elemental). Empiezan en Isla de Zephras con la misma misión de Hunter." },
   spells = { { 1, "Raptor Strike", "ability_meleedamage", "Golpe cuerpo a cuerpo: solo hace falta cuando el enemigo llega a ti. Tras 10 pierde casi todo su valor (Method).", false }, { 1, "Auto Shot", "ability_whirlwind", "Tu daño principal. Desde el 15 oct tienes que estar quieto 0.5 s antes de disparar; sigue funcionando mientras lanzas Aimed Shot.", false }, { 1, "Track Beasts", "ability_tracking", "Muestra bestias en el minimapa: necesario para encontrar mascotas que domesticar.", false }, { 4, "Serpent Sting", "ability_hunter_quickshot", "DoT de Naturaleza, sin daño inmediato: no lo uses en enemigos que mueran enseguida.", false }, { 4, "Aspect of the Monkey", "ability_hunter_aspectofthemonkey", "+8% de Dodge: te mantiene con vida antes de 10, cuando aún no tienes mascota.", false }, { 6, "Arcane Shot", "ability_impalingbolt", "Disparo Arcane instantáneo, CD de 6 s. Desde 25 comparte enfriamiento con Summon Hawk.", false }, { 6, "Hunter's Mark", "ability_hunter_snipershot", "Aumenta el Ranged Attack Power de quien ataque el objetivo, incluida la mascota (escala con tu AP).", false }, { 8, "Concussive Shot", "spell_frost_stun", "Ralentización a distancia (CD de 12 s): tu herramienta de kiting antes de tener mascota.", false }, { 10, "Aspect of the Hawk", "spell_nature_ravenform", "+Ranged Attack Power y la base de Deadly Aspects: siempre activo en combate.", false }, { 10, "Track Humanoids", "spell_holy_prayerofhealing", "Rastreo de humanoides.", false }, { 10, "Tame Beast / Beast Training / Feed Pet / Revive Pet / Call Pet / Dismiss Pet", "ability_hunter_beasttaming", "De la misión de clase de nivel 10 (Domesticar la bestia + Entrenar a la bestia). No puedes domesticar bestias por encima de tu nivel, ni con una mascota activa.", false }, { 12, "Mend Pet", "ability_hunter_mendpet", "Cura a la mascota con canalización (5 s): esencial contra élites o grupos.", false }, { 12, "Wing Clip", "ability_rogue_trip", "Ralentización cuerpo a cuerpo (40 de maná): si el enemigo llega a ti.", false }, { 12, "Distracting Shot", "spell_arcane_blink", "Amenaza instantánea a distancia.", false }, { 14, "Scare Beast", "ability_druid_cower", "Miedo a una Bestia (10 s): cuidado, el enemigo puede correr hacia otros grupos.", false }, { 14, "Eyes of the Beast / Eagle Eye", "ability_eyeoftheowl", "Exploración: controla tu mascota o aleja la cámara desde lejos; Eyes of the Beast te permite atraer enemigos desde muy lejos.", false }, { 16, "Immolation Trap", "spell_fire_flameshock", "Trampa de fuego (DoT): usable en combate y escala con AP (15 oct).", false }, { 16, "Mongoose Bite", "ability_hunter_swiftstrike", "Golpe cuerpo a cuerpo: útil sobre todo para Survival.", false }, { 18, "Multi-Shot", "ability_upgrademoonglaive", "AoE en 3 objetivos; comparte enfriamiento (6 s) con Aimed Shot.", false }, { 20, "Aimed Shot", "inv_spear_07", "Base para todos los Hunters (talento de Classic Era): lanzamiento de 2 s, CD de 6 s compartido con Multi-Shot. Tu disparo a objetivo único.", false }, { 20, "Freezing Trap", "spell_frost_chainsofice", "CC de 10 s sobre el primer enemigo que pase (se rompe con daño); usable en combate. CD de 30 s compartido con Frost Trap.", false }, { 20, "Aspect of the Cheetah", "ability_mount_jungletiger", "+30% de velocidad fuera de combate: si te golpean, quedas Dazed.", false }, { 20, "Disengage", "ability_rogue_feint", "Reduce el threat sobre el objetivo ( doble desde el 8 oct).", false }, { 22, "Scorpid Sting", "ability_hunter_criticalshot", "Cambiado: 2% de probabilidad de que te golpee durante 20 s (ya no reduce Strength ni Agility).", false }, { 24, "Track Hidden", "ability_stealth", "Detecta unidades sigilosas en el minimapa (Method: «increíble» para misiones).", false }, { 24, "Beast Lore", "ability_physical_taunt", "Información de bestias: útil para saber qué enseñará una mascota que quieras domesticar.", false }, { 25, "Summon Hawk", "ability_hunter_animalhandler", "Talento de BM (punto 16): halcón que ataca durante 18 s, máx. 2; 11% del maná base (hotfix del 10 nov), enfriamiento de 6 s compartido con Arcane Shot.", true }, { 26, "Rapid Fire", "ability_hunter_runningshot", "CD de 5 min: +40% de velocidad de ataque a distancia y cuerpo a cuerpo durante 15 s. Úsalo en pulls difíciles.", false }, { 26, "Track Elementals", "spell_frost_summonwaterelemental", "Rastreo de elementales.", false }, { 28, "Frost Trap", "spell_frost_freezingbreath", "Área que ralentiza un 60% durante 30 s: esencial para pulls múltiples.", false }, { 30, "Feign Death", "ability_rogue_feigndeath", "Sale del combate (puede fallar): pon antes la mascota en pasivo.", false }, { 30, "Aspect of the Beast", "ability_mount_pinktiger", "Da Melee Attack Power y te hace indetectable: para cuando el enemigo llegue a ti.", false }, { 30, "Intimidation", "ability_devour", "Talento de BM: requiere Bestial Swiftness; aturdimiento de 3 s en el siguiente ataque de la mascota, +100% crit en ese golpe.", true }, { 32, "Flare", "spell_fire_flare", "Revela sigilo e invisibilidad a 10 yd. Rastrea Demonios del mismo nivel (Warcraft Tavern).", false }, { 34, "Explosive Trap", "spell_fire_selfdestruct", "Trampa de fuego en área. Serpent Sting 5 y Disengage 2 del mismo nivel.", false }, { 36, "Viper Sting", "ability_hunter_aimedshot", "Drena maná del objetivo. Del mismo nivel: Summon Hawk 2, Aimed Shot 3, Arcane Shot 5, Mend Pet 4.", false }, { 40, "Aspect of the Pack", "ability_mount_whitetiger", "+30% de velocidad para todo el grupo. Volley, Track Giants, Freezing Trap 2, Apprentice Riding y Dual Specialization del mismo nivel.", false }, { 40, "Bestial Wrath", "ability_druid_ferociousbite", "Talento de BM (31.º punto): mascota +50% de daño durante 18 s, CD de 2 min.", true }, { 46, "Aspect of the Wild", "spell_nature_protectionformnature", "Resistencia a la Naturaleza para el grupo.", false }, { 50, "Track Dragonkin", "ability_tracking", "Rastreo de Dragonkin.", false }, { 56, "Trueshot Aura", "ability_trueshot", "Talento de MM de la build de nivel 60: +RAP a grupo y banda en 45 yd.", true }, { 60, "Tranquilizing Shot", "spell_nature_drowsy", "Elimina un efecto de Frenzy/Enrage del enemigo.", false } },
   bsp = { b = { { 1, "Raptor Strike", "ability_meleedamage", "Golpe cuerpo a cuerpo: solo hace falta cuando el enemigo llega a ti. Tras 10 pierde casi todo su valor (Method).", false }, { 1, "Auto Shot", "ability_whirlwind", "Tu daño principal. Desde el 15 oct tienes que estar quieto 0.5 s antes de disparar; sigue funcionando mientras lanzas Aimed Shot.", false }, { 1, "Track Beasts", "ability_tracking", "Muestra bestias en el minimapa: necesario para encontrar mascotas que domesticar.", false }, { 4, "Serpent Sting", "ability_hunter_quickshot", "DoT de Naturaleza, sin daño inmediato: no lo uses en enemigos que mueran enseguida.", false }, { 4, "Aspect of the Monkey", "ability_hunter_aspectofthemonkey", "+8% de Dodge: te mantiene con vida antes de 10, cuando aún no tienes mascota.", false }, { 6, "Arcane Shot", "ability_impalingbolt", "Disparo Arcane instantáneo, CD de 6 s. Desde 25 comparte enfriamiento con Summon Hawk.", false }, { 6, "Hunter's Mark", "ability_hunter_snipershot", "Aumenta el Ranged Attack Power de quien ataque el objetivo, incluida la mascota (escala con tu AP).", false }, { 8, "Concussive Shot", "spell_frost_stun", "Ralentización a distancia (CD de 12 s): tu herramienta de kiting antes de tener mascota.", false }, { 10, "Aspect of the Hawk", "spell_nature_ravenform", "+Ranged Attack Power y la base de Deadly Aspects: siempre activo en combate.", false }, { 10, "Track Humanoids", "spell_holy_prayerofhealing", "Rastreo de humanoides.", false }, { 10, "Tame Beast / Beast Training / Feed Pet / Revive Pet / Call Pet / Dismiss Pet", "ability_hunter_beasttaming", "De la misión de clase de nivel 10 (Domesticar la bestia + Entrenar a la bestia). No puedes domesticar bestias por encima de tu nivel, ni con una mascota activa.", false }, { 12, "Mend Pet", "ability_hunter_mendpet", "Cura a la mascota con canalización (5 s): esencial contra élites o grupos.", false }, { 12, "Wing Clip", "ability_rogue_trip", "Ralentización cuerpo a cuerpo (40 de maná): si el 