    forever = { "Mixology: elixirs and flasks last longer and are stronger (wowforever.be hub; WT). The '2x duration and +25%' figure comes from the BlizzCon demo, not from beta data: .", "Philosopher's Stone: a piece of jewelry that grows with skill (wowforever.be).", "Healing potions moved from Alchemy to First Aid (wowforever.be First Aid, WT). WT comments also say there's no more Jewelcrafting: not verified.", "70 new recipes out of 185 (wowforever.be Alchemy)." }, camp = "Mana Well (20, Peacebloom + Empty Vial): mana for those sitting nearby; does not stack with Blessing of Wisdom (Kami Labs). Tier 2 Fermenter (140: Leaded Vial, Kingsblood, Swiftthistle). Tier 3 Alchemy Laboratory (300: Lich's Index Finger, Crystal Vial, 2 Dreamfoil).", gold = "Kami Labs: full cost 1–225 with recipes and vials around 19g53s (beta estimate, mostly from herbs you gather). Vials: Crystal Vial 25 silver, Empty Vial 20 copper, Leaded Vial 2 silver. Recurring potions = constant demand (search snippet, ). Potion sale prices: not found.", tips = { "Don't craft what you can't sell: you lose gold and only recover skill (search snippet, ).", "Kami Labs: the 250–300 recipes are 'after beta', verify them in game before planning.", "Herbalism as a pair: gathering herbs yourself avoids buying them on AH (search snippet, )." } },
